[2026-04-16 23:37:58] WARNING parser.py:729: Timeout during parsing: ĊAlright,ĠsoĠIĠhaveĠthisĠmathĠproblemĠhereĠaboutĠcoloringĠlineĠsegmentsĠinĠaĠgrid.ĠLetĠmeĠtryĠtoĠunderstandĠitĠstepĠbyĠstep.ĊĊFirst,ĠtheĠproblemĠmentionsĠaĠ2x3Ġgrid.ĠSo,ĠIĠimagineĠaĠgridĠwithĠ2ĠrowsĠandĠ3Ġcolumns.ĠThatĠwouldĠmeanĠthereĠareĠ2ĠrowsĠverticallyĠandĠ3ĠcolumnsĠhorizontally.ĠEachĠcellĠinĠtheĠgridĠisĠaĠsquare,ĠandĠeachĠsquareĠhasĠfourĠsides,ĠwhichĠareĠtheĠlineĠsegmentsĠwe'reĠtalkingĠabout.ĊĊNow,ĠtheĠproblemĠsaysĠthatĠeachĠofĠtheĠ12ĠunitĠlineĠsegmentsĠformingĠtheĠsidesĠofĠtheĠsquaresĠisĠcoloredĠeitherĠredĠorĠblue.ĠTheĠconditionĠisĠthatĠeachĠunitĠsquareĠmustĠhaveĠexactlyĠ2ĠredĠsidesĠandĠ2ĠblueĠsides.ĠSo,ĠeveryĠsmallĠsquareĠinĠtheĠgridĠmustĠhaveĠtwoĠredĠedgesĠandĠtwoĠblueĠedges.ĊĊTheĠquestionĠisĠaskingĠforĠtheĠnumberĠofĠsuchĠcolorings.ĠSo,ĠhowĠmanyĠdifferentĠwaysĠcanĠweĠcolorĠallĠtheseĠlineĠsegmentsĠredĠorĠblueĠwhileĠsatisfyingĠtheĠconditionĠthatĠeveryĠsquareĠhasĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠandĠtwoĠblueĠsides.ĊĊToĠapproachĠthis,ĠIĠthinkĠitĠmightĠhelpĠtoĠmodelĠthisĠasĠaĠgraph.ĠEachĠintersectionĠpointĠinĠtheĠgridĠcanĠbeĠconsideredĠaĠvertex,ĠandĠeachĠlineĠsegmentĠisĠanĠedgeĠconnectingĠtwoĠvertices.ĠSo,ĠinĠaĠ2x3Ġgrid,ĠhowĠmanyĠverticesĠdoĠweĠhave?ĠLetĠmeĠcalculateĠthat.ĊĊForĠaĠgridĠwithĠmĠrowsĠandĠnĠcolumns,ĠtheĠnumberĠofĠverticesĠisĠ(m+1)*(n+1).ĠSoĠhere,Ġm=2ĠandĠn=3,ĠsoĠtheĠnumberĠofĠverticesĠisĠ(2+1)*(3+1)Ġ=Ġ3*4Ġ=Ġ12Ġvertices.ĠEachĠvertexĠisĠconnectedĠtoĠitsĠneighborsĠbyĠedges.ĠSo,ĠeachĠinteriorĠvertexĠisĠconnectedĠtoĠfourĠedgesĠ(up,Ġdown,Ġleft,Ġright),ĠwhileĠtheĠboundaryĠverticesĠhaveĠfewerĠedges.ĊĊButĠmaybeĠinsteadĠofĠthinkingĠaboutĠvertices,ĠIĠshouldĠfocusĠonĠtheĠedgesĠsinceĠwe'reĠcoloringĠthem.ĠThereĠareĠ12ĠunitĠlineĠsegments,ĠasĠgiven.ĠEachĠisĠeitherĠredĠorĠblue.ĠButĠtheĠconstraintĠisĠonĠeachĠsquare,ĠeachĠsquareĠmustĠhaveĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠedgesĠandĠtwoĠblueĠedges.ĊĊSo,ĠeachĠsquareĠhasĠfourĠedges,ĠandĠexactlyĠtwoĠareĠred,ĠtwoĠareĠblue.ĠSo,ĠforĠeachĠsquare,ĠtheĠcoloringĠmustĠsatisfyĠthatĠcondition.ĊĊIĠwonderĠifĠthisĠisĠsimilarĠtoĠaĠconstraintĠsatisfactionĠproblemĠwhereĠeachĠsquareĠimposesĠaĠconstraintĠonĠitsĠedges,ĠandĠweĠneedĠtoĠcountĠtheĠnumberĠofĠassignmentsĠthatĠsatisfyĠallĠconstraints.ĊĊOneĠwayĠtoĠmodelĠthisĠisĠusingĠgraphĠtheoryĠandĠperhapsĠlinearĠalgebra.ĠEachĠedgeĠhasĠaĠbinaryĠstate:ĠredĠorĠblue.ĠSo,ĠtheĠproblemĠisĠsimilarĠtoĠsolvingĠaĠsystemĠofĠequationsĠwhereĠeachĠequationĠcorrespondsĠtoĠaĠsquare'sĠconstraint.ĊĊButĠhowĠexactly?ĠLet'sĠsee.ĊĊEachĠsquareĠhasĠfourĠedges,ĠandĠweĠrequireĠthatĠexactlyĠtwoĠareĠred.ĠSo,ĠforĠeachĠsquare,ĠtheĠsumĠofĠitsĠfourĠedgesĠ(whereĠredĠisĠ1ĠandĠblueĠisĠ0)ĠmustĠequalĠ2.ĊĊThisĠgivesĠusĠaĠsystemĠofĠlinearĠequationsĠoverĠtheĠfieldĠGF(2).ĠHowever,ĠtheĠissueĠisĠthatĠourĠequationsĠareĠnotĠoverĠGF(2)ĠbecauseĠwe'reĠcountingĠtheĠnumberĠofĠredĠedges,ĠwhichĠisĠaĠcount,ĠnotĠaĠbinaryĠvariable.ĠSo,ĠtheĠequationsĠhereĠareĠactuallyĠoverĠintegers.ĊĊWait,ĠperhapsĠanotherĠapproachĠisĠbetter.ĊĊLetĠmeĠthinkĠinĠtermsĠofĠvariables.ĠEachĠedgeĠcanĠbeĠaĠvariableĠthatĠcanĠtakeĠtwoĠvalues:ĠredĠorĠblue.ĠSo,ĠinĠtotal,ĠwithoutĠanyĠconstraints,ĠthereĠareĠ2^12Ġ=Ġ4096ĠpossibleĠcolorings.ĊĊButĠwithĠconstraints:ĠeachĠsquareĠmustĠhaveĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠedges.ĠSo,ĠeachĠsquareĠimposesĠaĠconstraintĠthatĠreducesĠtheĠnumberĠofĠpossibleĠcolorings.ĊĊEachĠsquareĠhasĠfourĠedges,ĠsoĠeachĠsquare'sĠconstraintĠremovesĠsomeĠdegreesĠofĠfreedom.ĠHowĠmuchĠdoesĠeachĠconstraintĠreduceĠtheĠnumberĠofĠpossibilities?ĊĊInĠconstraintĠsatisfaction,ĠeachĠconstraintĠcanĠsometimesĠreduceĠtheĠdegreesĠofĠfreedomĠbyĠone,ĠbutĠit'sĠnotĠalwaysĠstraightforwardĠbecauseĠconstraintsĠcanĠbeĠdependentĠorĠindependent.ĊĊSo,ĠperhapsĠweĠcanĠmodelĠthisĠasĠaĠsystemĠwhereĠeachĠsquare'sĠconstraintĠisĠanĠequation,ĠandĠweĠcanĠfindĠtheĠnumberĠofĠsolutions.ĊĊButĠsinceĠeachĠconstraintĠisĠ"exactlyĠtwoĠredĠedges",Ġit'sĠaĠbitĠdifferentĠfromĠtypicalĠlinearĠconstraints.ĠEachĠconstraintĠisĠaĠhyperedgeĠthatĠrequiresĠexactlyĠtwoĠofĠitsĠfourĠvariablesĠtoĠbeĠred.ĊĊThisĠseemsĠsimilarĠtoĠaĠproblemĠinĠcombinatoricsĠknownĠasĠtheĠ"exactĠcoverĠproblem",ĠbutĠnotĠexactly.ĠAlternatively,Ġit'sĠsimilarĠtoĠcountingĠtheĠnumberĠofĠ2-regularĠhypergraphsĠonĠeachĠsquare.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠmaybeĠthinkĠofĠitĠasĠaĠMarkovĠrandomĠfieldĠwhereĠeachĠsquareĠmustĠhaveĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠedges,ĠbutĠthatĠmightĠbeĠmoreĠcomplicated.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠthinkĠrecursively:ĠtryĠtoĠbuildĠupĠtheĠgridĠandĠcountĠtheĠnumberĠofĠcoloringsĠthatĠsatisfyĠtheĠconstraints.ĊĊButĠforĠaĠ2x3Ġgrid,ĠmaybeĠit'sĠmanageableĠtoĠmodelĠeachĠpossibleĠcoloringĠstepĠbyĠstep.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠnoticeĠthatĠtheĠgridĠisĠaĠplanarĠgraph,ĠandĠtheĠproblemĠisĠequivalentĠtoĠcountingĠtheĠnumberĠofĠ2-regularĠedgeĠcoloringsĠforĠeachĠface.ĊĊWait,ĠbutĠeachĠsquareĠmustĠhaveĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠedgesĠandĠtwoĠblueĠedges.ĠSo,ĠforĠeachĠsquare,Ġit'sĠlikeĠchoosingĠaĠ2-regularĠgraphĠonĠitsĠfourĠedges.ĠThatĠis,ĠeachĠsquareĠmustĠhaveĠaĠsubgraphĠwhereĠeachĠvertexĠhasĠdegreeĠ0ĠorĠ2,ĠbutĠsinceĠtheĠedgesĠareĠcolored,Ġit'sĠlikeĠselectingĠaĠ2-regularĠsubgraphĠforĠeachĠsquare.ĊĊButĠinĠaĠ2x3Ġgrid,ĠtheĠsquaresĠshareĠedges.ĠTherefore,ĠtheĠcolorĠassignmentsĠareĠnotĠindependentĠacrossĠsquares.ĊĊThisĠseemsĠcomplicated,ĠbutĠperhapsĠweĠcanĠmodelĠtheĠproblemĠasĠaĠsystemĠofĠequationsĠwhereĠeachĠsquare'sĠconditionĠisĠanĠequationĠthatĠtheĠsumĠofĠitsĠedgesĠ(asĠred=1,Ġblue=0)ĠmustĠbeĠequalĠtoĠ2.ĠButĠwait,Ġactually,ĠthatĠwouldĠbeĠaĠlinearĠequationĠoverĠintegers,ĠwhichĠisn'tĠstraightforward.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠifĠweĠuseĠmoduloĠ2Ġarithmetic,ĠeachĠsquareĠwouldĠhaveĠanĠevenĠnumberĠofĠredĠedges,ĠbutĠhereĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠedges,ĠwhichĠisĠalsoĠeven,ĠsoĠoverĠGF(2),ĠtheĠequationsĠwouldĠbeĠthatĠtheĠsumĠofĠedgesĠperĠsquareĠisĠ0,ĠbutĠthatĠwouldĠincludeĠcasesĠwhereĠ0,Ġ2,ĠorĠ4ĠedgesĠareĠred,ĠwhichĠisĠnotĠexactlyĠwhatĠweĠwant.ĠSo,ĠGF(2)ĠmightĠnotĠdirectlyĠhelp.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠmodelĠitĠasĠaĠbinaryĠsystemĠwithĠeachĠsquare'sĠconstraintĠbeingĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠedges,ĠbutĠthisĠseemsĠdifficultĠbecauseĠtheĠdependenciesĠbetweenĠsquaresĠcanĠbeĠcomplex.ĊĊAnotherĠapproachĠisĠtoĠrecognizeĠthatĠtheĠgridĠisĠaĠbipartiteĠgraph.ĠEachĠsquare'sĠedgesĠformĠaĠcycleĠofĠfourĠedges.ĠSo,ĠeachĠsquareĠisĠaĠ4-cycle,ĠandĠinĠaĠ2x3Ġgrid,ĠtheĠentireĠgridĠisĠmadeĠupĠofĠtheseĠ4-cyclesĠconnectedĠtogether.ĊĊSo,ĠperhapsĠtheĠproblemĠisĠrelatedĠtoĠcountingĠtheĠnumberĠofĠ2-edge-coloringsĠ(redĠandĠblue)ĠofĠtheĠ4-cyclesĠsuchĠthatĠeachĠ4-cycleĠhasĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠedgesĠandĠtwoĠblueĠedges,ĠconsideringĠthatĠedgesĠareĠsharedĠbetweenĠadjacentĠsquares.ĊĊThisĠseemsĠsimilarĠtoĠcountingĠtheĠnumberĠofĠnowhere-zeroĠflowsĠorĠsomethingĠinĠgraphĠtheory,ĠbutĠnotĠexactly.ĠAlternatively,ĠmaybeĠit'sĠsimilarĠtoĠtheĠIsingĠmodelĠinĠphysics,ĠwhereĠeachĠedgeĠcanĠbeĠinĠoneĠofĠtwoĠstates,ĠbutĠagain,ĠnotĠexactly.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠmodelĠtheĠproblemĠasĠassigningĠaĠdirectionĠtoĠeachĠedge,ĠbutĠIĠdon'tĠseeĠanĠimmediateĠconnection.ĊĊWait,ĠmaybeĠinsteadĠofĠthinkingĠofĠredĠandĠblueĠasĠcolors,ĠthinkĠofĠthemĠasĠbinaryĠvariables,ĠandĠthenĠmodelĠtheĠconstraintsĠperĠsquareĠasĠequations.ĊĊEachĠsquareĠhasĠfourĠedges:Ġtop,Ġright,Ġbottom,Ġleft.ĊĊLetĠmeĠlabelĠtheĠedgesĠinĠtheĠgrid.ĠForĠaĠ2x3Ġgrid,ĠweĠhaveĠhorizontalĠedgesĠandĠverticalĠedges.ĠLet'sĠdenoteĠhorizontalĠedgesĠasĠH_ij,ĠwhereĠiĠisĠtheĠrowĠnumber,ĠandĠjĠisĠtheĠcolumnĠnumber.ĠSimilarly,ĠverticalĠedgesĠasĠV_ij.ĊĊInĠaĠ2x3Ġgrid,ĠtheĠhorizontalĠedgesĠwouldĠbe:ĊĊ-ĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH13Ġ(topĠhorizontalĠedgesĠofĠtheĠfirstĠrow)Ċ-ĠH21,ĠH22,ĠH23Ġ(topĠhorizontalĠedgesĠofĠtheĠsecondĠrow)Ċ-ĠH31,ĠH32,ĠH33Ġ(bottomĠhorizontalĠedgesĠofĠtheĠsecondĠrow,ĠbutĠsinceĠit'sĠaĠ2x3Ġgrid,ĠH31,ĠH32,ĠH33ĠareĠtheĠbottomĠedgesĠofĠtheĠsecondĠrow.ĊĊSimilarly,ĠverticalĠedges:ĊĊ-ĠV11,ĠV21Ġ(leftmostĠverticalĠedges)Ċ-ĠV12,ĠV22Ċ-ĠV13,ĠV23Ċ-ĠV14,ĠV24Ġ(rightmostĠverticalĠedges)ĊĊWait,ĠperhapsĠaĠbetterĠwayĠtoĠlabelĠthem:ĊĊForĠeachĠcellĠ(i,j),ĠtheĠtopĠedgeĠisĠH_{i,j},ĠtheĠrightĠedgeĠisĠV_{i,j+1},ĠtheĠbottomĠedgeĠisĠH_{i+1,j},ĠandĠtheĠleftĠedgeĠisĠV_{i,j}.ĊĊButĠinĠaĠ2x3Ġgrid,ĠiĠrangesĠfromĠ1ĠtoĠ2Ġ(rows),ĠjĠrangesĠfromĠ1ĠtoĠ3Ġ(columns).ĊĊSo,Ġlet'sĠdefine:ĊĊ-ĠForĠeachĠcellĠ(i,j),ĠitĠhasĠfourĠedges:ĊĠĠ-ĠTop:ĠH_{i,j}ĊĠĠ-ĠRight:ĠV_{i,j+1}ĊĠĠ-ĠBottom:ĠH_{i+1,j}ĊĠĠ-ĠLeft:ĠV_{i,j}ĊĊSo,ĠforĠeachĠcellĠ(i,j),ĠtheĠconstraintĠisĠthatĠamongĠH_{i,j},ĠV_{i,j+1},ĠH_{i+1,j},ĠV_{i,j},ĠexactlyĠtwoĠareĠred.ĊĊThen,ĠtheĠtotalĠnumberĠofĠedgesĠis:ĊĊ-ĠHorizontal:Ġ3ĠedgesĠperĠrow,Ġ2Ġrows,ĠsoĠ3*2=6ĠhorizontalĠedges?ĠWaitĠno:ĠinĠeachĠrow,ĠtheĠnumberĠofĠhorizontalĠedgesĠisĠequalĠtoĠtheĠnumberĠofĠcolumns,ĠwhichĠisĠ3,ĠandĠsinceĠeachĠrowĠisĠdividedĠintoĠ3Ġcolumns,ĠthereĠareĠ3ĠhorizontalĠedgesĠperĠrow,ĠbutĠforĠ2Ġrows,Ġit'sĠ3*(2+1)Ġ=Ġ9?ĠWait,Ġno.ĊĊWait,ĠconfusionĠhere.ĠLetĠmeĠthinkĠagain.ĊĊInĠaĠgridĠwithĠ2ĠrowsĠandĠ3Ġcolumns:ĊĊ-ĠTheĠnumberĠofĠhorizontalĠedges:ĠEachĠrowĠhasĠ(numberĠofĠcolumns)ĠhorizontalĠedges,ĠandĠthereĠareĠ(numberĠofĠrowsĠ+Ġ1)ĠhorizontalĠlines.ĠSo,Ġ3ĠhorizontalĠedgesĠperĠhorizontalĠline,ĠandĠ2+1=3ĠhorizontalĠlines.ĠSo,Ġ3*3=9ĠhorizontalĠedges.ĊĊSimilarly,ĠtheĠnumberĠofĠverticalĠedges:ĠEachĠcolumnĠhasĠ(numberĠofĠrows)ĠverticalĠedges,ĠandĠthereĠareĠ(numberĠofĠcolumnsĠ+1)ĠverticalĠlines.ĠSo,Ġ2ĠverticalĠedgesĠperĠverticalĠline,ĠandĠ3+1=4ĠverticalĠlines.ĠSo,Ġ2*4=8ĠverticalĠedges.ĊĊWait,ĠthatĠcan'tĠbe,ĠbecauseĠinĠtheĠproblemĠstatement,Ġit'sĠmentionedĠthatĠthereĠareĠ12ĠunitĠlineĠsegments.ĊĊWait,Ġ2x3Ġgrid:Ġ2Ġrows,Ġ3Ġcolumns.ĊĊNumberĠofĠhorizontalĠedges:ĠForĠeachĠofĠtheĠ3Ġcolumns,ĠthereĠareĠ3ĠhorizontalĠedgesĠ(top,Ġmiddle,Ġbottom).ĠWait,Ġno:Ġ2ĠrowsĠmeanĠ3ĠhorizontalĠlinesĠ(top,ĠbetweenĠrows,Ġbottom).ĠEachĠhorizontalĠlineĠhasĠ3ĠedgesĠ(separatingĠtheĠ3Ġcolumns).ĠSo,Ġ3ĠhorizontalĠlinesĠ*Ġ3ĠedgesĠ=Ġ9ĠhorizontalĠedges.ĊĊSimilarly,ĠverticalĠedges:ĠForĠeachĠofĠtheĠ3Ġrows,ĠthereĠareĠ4ĠverticalĠlinesĠ(separatingĠtheĠcolumns).ĠEachĠverticalĠlineĠhasĠ2ĠedgesĠ(topĠandĠbottom).ĠSo,Ġ4ĠverticalĠlinesĠ*Ġ2ĠedgesĠ=Ġ8ĠverticalĠedges.ĊĊSo,ĠtotalĠedges:Ġ9Ġ+Ġ8Ġ=Ġ17Ġedges?ĠWait,ĠthatĠcontradictsĠtheĠproblemĠstatementĠwhichĠsaysĠ12ĠunitĠlineĠsegments.ĠHmm,ĠconfusionĠhere.ĊĊWait,ĠperhapsĠtheĠproblemĠisĠconsideringĠaĠ2x3ĠgridĠofĠsquares,ĠmeaningĠ2ĠsquaresĠinĠwidthĠandĠ3ĠinĠheight?ĠOrĠ2x3Ġsquares,ĠmeaningĠ3x4ĠgridĠpoints.ĊĊWait,ĠtheĠproblemĠsaysĠ"7(2)ÃĹ3(2)5(grid)",ĠwhichĠmapsĠtoĠ"2ÃĹ2Ġgrid"ĠaccordingĠtoĠtheĠtransformationĠrules.ĠWait,ĠholdĠon.ĊĊWait,ĠletĠmeĠrecheckĠtheĠtransformationĠrulesĠbecauseĠIĠmightĠhaveĠmisunderstoodĠtheĠgridĠsize.ĊĊLookingĠback,ĠtheĠtransformationĠruleĠsays:ĊĊ"let"7(2)"mean"2",Ġlet"3(2)"mean"2",Ġlet"5(grid)"mean"grid",Ġlet"8(12)"mean"12",Ġlet"10(unit)"mean"unit",Ġlet"2(line)"mean"line",Ġlet"6(segments)"mean"segments",Ġetc.ĊĊSo,ĠtheĠtransformedĠinputĠwasĠ"6(Four)4(unit)9(squares)Ġforma$7(2)ÃĹ3(2)$5(grid)."ĊĊSo,Ġ"Four"ĠmapsĠtoĠ"Four",Ġ"unit"ĠmapsĠtoĠ"unit",Ġ"squares"ĠmapsĠtoĠ"squares",ĠsoĠ"FourĠunitĠsquaresĠformaĠ2ÃĹ2Ġgrid."ĠEachĠofĠtheĠ"8(12)"ĠunitĠlineĠsegmentsĠformingĠtheĠ"10(sides)"ĠofĠtheĠ"3(squares)"ĠisĠcoloredĠeitherĠredĠorĠblueĠinĠsuchĠaĠ"9(way)"ĠthatĠeachĠ"7(unit)"ĠsquareĠhasĠ"8(2)"ĠredĠ"7(sides)"ĠandĠ"3(2)"ĠblueĠ"5(sides)".ĊĊWait,ĠsoĠwait,ĠtheĠoriginalĠtransformedĠinputĠwasĠaboutĠ4ĠunitĠsquaresĠformingĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid,ĠwithĠ12ĠunitĠlineĠsegments.ĠSo,Ġactually,ĠtheĠgridĠisĠ2x2,ĠnotĠ2x3.ĊĊWait,Ġthat'sĠdifferent.ĠSo,ĠtheĠgridĠisĠ2x2Ġsquares,ĠmeaningĠ3x3ĠgridĠpoints.ĊĊSo,ĠnumberĠofĠhorizontalĠedges:Ġ3ĠrowsĠofĠhorizontalĠedges,ĠeachĠwithĠ2Ġedges,ĠsoĠ3*2=6.ĊĊNumberĠofĠverticalĠedges:Ġ3ĠcolumnsĠofĠverticalĠedges,ĠeachĠwithĠ2Ġedges,ĠsoĠ3*2=6.ĊĊTotalĠedges:Ġ6+6=12,ĠwhichĠmatchesĠtheĠproblemĠstatement.ĊĊSo,ĠIĠwasĠinitiallyĠconfusedĠbecauseĠIĠthoughtĠitĠwasĠ2x3,ĠbutĠit'sĠactuallyĠaĠ2x2ĠgridĠofĠsquares,ĠwhichĠisĠaĠ3x3ĠgridĠofĠpoints,ĠwithĠ12Ġedges.ĊĊSo,ĠthatĠclarifiesĠit.ĠSo,ĠtheĠgridĠisĠ2x2Ġsquares,Ġ3x3Ġvertices,Ġ12Ġedges.ĊĊEachĠsquareĠisĠaĠunitĠsquare,ĠandĠeachĠhasĠfourĠedges.ĠEachĠedgeĠisĠsharedĠbetweenĠtwoĠsquares,ĠexceptĠforĠtheĠboundaryĠedges.ĊĊSo,ĠeachĠofĠtheĠ12ĠedgesĠisĠpartĠofĠoneĠorĠtwoĠsquares.ĊĊSo,ĠeachĠedgeĠisĠeitherĠonĠtheĠboundaryĠ(partĠofĠonlyĠoneĠsquare)ĠorĠinternalĠ(partĠofĠtwoĠsquares).ĊĊEachĠsquareĠmustĠhaveĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠedgesĠandĠtwoĠblueĠedges.ĊĊSo,ĠtheĠproblemĠisĠtoĠcolorĠeachĠedgeĠredĠorĠblueĠsuchĠthatĠeveryĠsquareĠhasĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠandĠtwoĠblueĠedges.ĊĊSo,ĠinĠtotal,ĠhowĠmanyĠcoloringsĠareĠthere?ĊĊThisĠseemsĠtoĠbeĠaĠwell-knownĠproblemĠinĠcombinatorics,ĠpossiblyĠrelatedĠtoĠtheĠnumberĠofĠEulerianĠorientationsĠorĠsomethingĠelse.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠmaybeĠit'sĠsimilarĠtoĠtilingsĠorĠsomething.ĊĊWait,ĠanotherĠthought:ĠinĠsuchĠaĠgrid,ĠeachĠinternalĠedgeĠisĠsharedĠbyĠtwoĠsquares.ĠSo,ĠcoloringĠanĠinternalĠedgeĠredĠorĠblueĠaffectsĠtwoĠsquares.ĠTherefore,ĠtheĠcolorĠassignmentsĠareĠnotĠindependent,ĠandĠweĠneedĠtoĠsatisfyĠtheĠconditionĠforĠbothĠsquaresĠsharingĠanĠinternalĠedge.ĊĊGivenĠthat,ĠtheĠproblemĠisĠaboutĠassigningĠcolorsĠtoĠedgesĠsuchĠthatĠeveryĠsquareĠhasĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠandĠtwoĠblueĠedges.ĊĊThisĠseemsĠsimilarĠtoĠaĠproblemĠwhereĠeachĠfaceĠmustĠhaveĠanĠevenĠnumberĠofĠredĠedges,ĠbutĠhereĠit'sĠexactlyĠtwo.ĊĊWait,ĠperhapsĠthinkĠofĠthisĠasĠaĠflowĠproblemĠwhereĠeachĠsquareĠmustĠhaveĠinflowĠequalĠtoĠoutflow,ĠbutĠwithĠtwoĠredĠedgesĠandĠtwoĠblueĠedges.ĠMaybeĠnotĠdirectlyĠapplicable.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠconsiderĠthatĠeachĠsquareĠmustĠhaveĠaĠ2-regularĠsubgraph,ĠmeaningĠthatĠtheĠredĠedgesĠformĠaĠ2-regularĠgraphĠonĠeachĠsquare,ĠbutĠsinceĠedgesĠareĠshared,ĠtheĠentireĠgrid'sĠredĠedgesĠmustĠformĠaĠ2-regularĠgraph.ĊĊWait,ĠaĠ2-regularĠgraphĠisĠaĠcollectionĠofĠcycles.ĠSo,ĠifĠallĠredĠedgesĠformĠcycles,ĠandĠeachĠsquareĠcontributesĠtwoĠredĠedges,ĠthenĠperhapsĠtheĠentireĠredĠedgesĠmustĠformĠcyclesĠthatĠcoverĠallĠsquaresĠappropriately.ĊĊButĠinĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid,ĠwhichĠisĠaĠplanarĠgraph,ĠtheĠpossibleĠcyclesĠcanĠbeĠtheĠfacesĠthemselvesĠorĠlargerĠcycles.ĊĊWait,ĠbutĠeachĠsquareĠmustĠhaveĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠedges.ĠSo,ĠinĠeachĠsquare,ĠtheĠredĠedgesĠcanĠeitherĠformĠtwoĠadjacentĠedgesĠ(likeĠaĠ"corner")ĠorĠtwoĠoppositeĠedgesĠ(likeĠaĠ"cross").ĊĊButĠinĠtheĠcaseĠofĠtwoĠadjacentĠredĠedges,ĠthatĠwouldĠformĠaĠlocalĠassignment,ĠbutĠsinceĠedgesĠareĠshared,ĠthisĠmightĠpropagateĠconstraintsĠtoĠadjacentĠsquares.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠtheĠredĠedgesĠmustĠformĠaĠperfectĠmatchingĠonĠeachĠsquare,ĠbutĠthatĠmightĠnotĠnecessarilyĠhold.ĊĊWait,ĠmaybeĠit'sĠhelpfulĠtoĠthinkĠinĠtermsĠofĠgraphĠtheoryĠandĠtheĠconceptĠofĠaĠ2-factor.ĠAĠ2-factorĠisĠaĠspanningĠ2-regularĠsubgraph,ĠwhichĠisĠaĠcollectionĠofĠcyclesĠthatĠcoverĠallĠvertices.ĊĊButĠinĠourĠcase,ĠweĠdon'tĠrequireĠcoveringĠallĠvertices,ĠbutĠratherĠeachĠfaceĠ(square)ĠmustĠhaveĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠedges.ĊĊWait,ĠperhapsĠit'sĠbetterĠtoĠmodelĠthisĠasĠaĠconstraintĠsatisfactionĠproblemĠwithĠeachĠsquareĠasĠaĠconstraint.ĊĊEachĠsquareĠhasĠfourĠedges,ĠandĠeachĠedgeĠisĠsharedĠwithĠadjacentĠsquares.ĠSo,ĠtheĠcoloringĠmustĠsatisfyĠallĠconstraintsĠsimultaneously.ĊĊThisĠseemsĠcomplicated,ĠbutĠforĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid,ĠmaybeĠmanageable.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠuseĠtheĠprincipleĠofĠinclusion-exclusionĠorĠBurnside'sĠlemma,ĠbutĠIĠdon'tĠseeĠanĠimmediateĠapplication.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠthinkĠofĠitĠasĠaĠsystemĠofĠlinearĠequationsĠwhereĠeachĠsquareĠcontributesĠanĠequation,ĠandĠvariablesĠareĠedgesĠ(red=1,Ġblue=0).ĠTheĠequationĠforĠeachĠsquareĠisĠthatĠtheĠsumĠofĠitsĠfourĠedgesĠequalsĠ2.ĊĊSo,ĠweĠcanĠmodelĠthisĠasĠaĠsystemĠofĠ4ĠequationsĠ(sinceĠ2x2ĠgridĠhasĠ4Ġsquares)ĠwithĠ12ĠvariablesĠ(edges),ĠeachĠvariableĠbeingĠ0ĠorĠ1,ĠandĠeachĠequationĠbeingĠtheĠsumĠequalsĠ2.ĊĊHowever,ĠsinceĠtheseĠareĠintegers,Ġit'sĠanĠintegerĠlinearĠsystem.ĠButĠsolvingĠsuchĠaĠsystemĠforĠtheĠnumberĠofĠsolutionsĠisĠnon-trivial.ĊĊButĠperhapsĠweĠcanĠfindĠtheĠnumberĠofĠsolutionsĠbyĠanalyzingĠtheĠdependencies.ĊĊFirst,ĠnoteĠthatĠtheĠequationsĠareĠnotĠallĠindependent.ĠBecauseĠeachĠinternalĠedgeĠisĠsharedĠbyĠtwoĠsquares,ĠtheĠequationsĠareĠdependent.ĊĊSo,Ġlet'sĠtryĠtoĠwriteĠdownĠtheĠsystem.ĊĊLabelĠtheĠedgesĠasĠfollows:ĊĊLetĠmeĠrepresentĠtheĠgridĠwithĠverticesĠlabeledĠasĠ(i,j)ĠwhereĠi=1,2,3ĠandĠj=1,2,3.ĊĊSo,ĠtheĠedgesĠare:ĊĊHorizontalĠedges:ĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH13,ĠH21,ĠH22,ĠH23,ĠH31,ĠH32,ĠH33.ĊĊVerticalĠedges:ĠV11,ĠV12,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV22,ĠV23,ĠV31,ĠV32,ĠV33.ĊĊButĠactually,ĠinĠaĠ3x3ĠgridĠofĠvertices,ĠtheĠhorizontalĠedgesĠare:ĊĊTopĠrow:ĠH11Ġ(betweenĠ(1,1)ĠandĠ(1,2)),ĠH12Ġ(betweenĠ(1,2)ĠandĠ(1,3)).ĊĊMiddleĠrow:ĠH21Ġ(betweenĠ(2,1)ĠandĠ(2,2)),ĠH22Ġ(betweenĠ(2,2)ĠandĠ(2,3)).ĊĊBottomĠrow:ĠH31Ġ(betweenĠ(3,1)ĠandĠ(3,2)),ĠH32Ġ(betweenĠ(3,2)ĠandĠ(3,3)).ĊĊSimilarly,ĠverticalĠedges:ĊĊLeftmostĠcolumn:ĠV11Ġ(betweenĠ(1,1)ĠandĠ(2,1)),ĠV21Ġ(betweenĠ(2,1)ĠandĠ(3,1)).ĊĊMiddleĠcolumn:ĠV12Ġ(betweenĠ(1,2)ĠandĠ(2,2)),ĠV22Ġ(betweenĠ(2,2)ĠandĠ(3,2)).ĊĊRightmostĠcolumn:ĠV13Ġ(betweenĠ(1,3)ĠandĠ(2,3)),ĠV23Ġ(betweenĠ(2,3)ĠandĠ(3,3)).ĊĊSo,ĠtotalĠhorizontalĠedges:ĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH21,ĠH22,ĠH31,ĠH32Ġ(6Ġedges).ĊĊTotalĠverticalĠedges:ĠV11,ĠV12,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV22,ĠV23Ġ(6Ġedges).ĊĊTotalĠedges:Ġ12,ĠasĠexpected.ĊĊNow,ĠeachĠsquareĠisĠdefinedĠbyĠitsĠtop-leftĠvertex.ĠSo,ĠsquaresĠare:ĊĊ-ĠSquareĠ(1,1):ĠhasĠedgesĠH11Ġ(top),ĠV12Ġ(right),ĠH21Ġ(bottom),ĠV11Ġ(left).ĊĊ-ĠSquareĠ(1,2):ĠhasĠedgesĠH12Ġ(top),ĠV13Ġ(right),ĠH22Ġ(bottom),ĠV12Ġ(left).ĊĊ-ĠSquareĠ(2,1):ĠhasĠedgesĠH21Ġ(top),ĠV22Ġ(right),ĠH31Ġ(bottom),ĠV21Ġ(left).ĊĊ-ĠSquareĠ(2,2):ĠhasĠedgesĠH22Ġ(top),ĠV23Ġ(right),ĠH32Ġ(bottom),ĠV22Ġ(left).ĊĊSo,ĠeachĠsquareĠhasĠfourĠedges,ĠandĠweĠneedĠeachĠsquareĠtoĠhaveĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠedges.ĊĊSo,ĠforĠeachĠsquare,ĠtheĠsumĠofĠitsĠfourĠedgesĠ(asĠvariables)ĠequalsĠ2.ĊĊSo,ĠwritingĠtheĠequations:ĊĊ1.ĠSquareĠ(1,1):ĠH11Ġ+ĠV12Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV11Ġ=Ġ2ĊĊ2.ĠSquareĠ(1,2):ĠH12Ġ+ĠV13Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12Ġ=Ġ2ĊĊ3.ĠSquareĠ(2,1):ĠH21Ġ+ĠV22Ġ+ĠH31Ġ+ĠV21Ġ=Ġ2ĊĊ4.ĠSquareĠ(2,2):ĠH22Ġ+ĠV23Ġ+ĠH32Ġ+ĠV22Ġ=Ġ2ĊĊAdditionally,ĠweĠhaveĠtheĠvariables:ĊĊHorizontalĠedges:ĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH21,ĠH22,ĠH31,ĠH32.ĊĊVerticalĠedges:ĠV11,ĠV12,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV22,ĠV23.ĊĊEachĠvariableĠisĠ0ĠorĠ1Ġ(blueĠorĠred).ĊĊSo,Ġthat'sĠfourĠequationsĠwithĠtwelveĠvariables.ĠSo,ĠtheĠsystemĠisĠunderdetermined.ĠButĠweĠneedĠtoĠfindĠtheĠnumberĠofĠsolutionsĠwhereĠeachĠvariableĠisĠ0ĠorĠ1.ĊĊMoreover,ĠtheĠequationsĠareĠnotĠallĠindependent.ĠLet'sĠcheckĠforĠdependencies.ĊĊLetĠmeĠaddĠallĠfourĠequations:ĊĊ(H11Ġ+ĠV12Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV11)Ġ+Ġ(H12Ġ+ĠV13Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12)Ġ+Ġ(H21Ġ+ĠV22Ġ+ĠH31Ġ+ĠV21)Ġ+Ġ(H22Ġ+ĠV23Ġ+ĠH32Ġ+ĠV22)Ġ=Ġ8ĊĊSimplifyĠleftĠside:ĊĊH11Ġ+ĠH12Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠH31Ġ+ĠH32Ġ+ĠV11Ġ+ĠV12Ġ+ĠV12Ġ+ĠV13Ġ+ĠV21Ġ+ĠV22Ġ+ĠV22Ġ+ĠV23.ĊĊSimplifyĠfurther:ĊĊH11Ġ+ĠH12Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠH31Ġ+ĠH32Ġ+ĠV11Ġ+Ġ2V12Ġ+ĠV13Ġ+ĠV21Ġ+Ġ2V22Ġ+ĠV23Ġ=Ġ8ĊĊNow,ĠconsiderĠtheĠtotalĠnumberĠofĠredĠedgesĠinĠtheĠentireĠgrid.ĠEachĠhorizontalĠedgeĠisĠcountedĠonce,ĠeachĠverticalĠedgeĠisĠcountedĠonce,ĠexceptĠforĠV12,ĠV22,ĠwhichĠareĠcountedĠtwice.ĊĊButĠwait,ĠinĠreality,ĠeachĠinternalĠverticalĠedgeĠ(V12,ĠV22)ĠisĠsharedĠbetweenĠtwoĠsquares,ĠsoĠinĠtheĠtotalĠsumĠoverĠallĠsquares,ĠtheyĠareĠcountedĠtwice.ĠTheĠboundaryĠverticalĠedgesĠ(V11,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV23)ĠareĠonlyĠinĠoneĠsquareĠeach,ĠsoĠcountedĠonce.ĊĊSimilarly,ĠforĠhorizontalĠedges,ĠinternalĠonesĠ(H21,ĠH22)ĠareĠsharedĠbetweenĠtwoĠsquaresĠ(aboveĠandĠbelow),ĠwhileĠtheĠtopĠandĠbottomĠhorizontalĠedgesĠ(H11,ĠH12,ĠH31,ĠH32)ĠareĠonlyĠinĠoneĠsquareĠeach.ĊĊButĠwait,ĠinĠourĠsumĠabove,ĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH31,ĠH32ĠareĠonlyĠinĠoneĠsquareĠeach,ĠsoĠtheyĠareĠonlyĠonce,ĠwhileĠH21,ĠH22ĠareĠinĠtwoĠsquaresĠeachĠ(theĠsquaresĠaboveĠandĠbelowĠthem),ĠsoĠtheyĠareĠcountedĠtwice.ĊĊWait,ĠbutĠinĠourĠinitialĠequationĠsum,ĠweĠhave:ĊĊEachĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH31,ĠH32Ġonce.ĊĊEachĠH21,ĠH22Ġtwice.ĊĊSimilarlyĠforĠV:ĠV11,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV23ĠonceĠeach,ĠandĠV12,ĠV22ĠtwiceĠeach.ĊĊTherefore,ĠtheĠtotalĠsumĠis:ĊĊSumĠofĠallĠhorizontalĠedgesĠ*ĠtheirĠcountsĠ+ĠSumĠofĠallĠverticalĠedgesĠ*ĠtheirĠcountsĠ=Ġ8.ĊĊBut,ĠtheĠtotalĠnumberĠofĠredĠedgesĠcanĠbeĠcalculatedĠas:ĊĊTotalĠredĠhorizontalĠedges:ĠH11Ġ+ĠH12Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠH31Ġ+ĠH32.ĊĊTotalĠredĠverticalĠedges:ĠV11Ġ+ĠV12Ġ+ĠV13Ġ+ĠV21Ġ+ĠV22Ġ+ĠV23.ĊĊEachĠinternalĠhorizontalĠedgeĠ(H21,ĠH22)ĠisĠsharedĠbyĠtwoĠsquares,ĠsoĠinĠtheĠtotalĠsumĠoverĠsquares,Ġthey'reĠcountedĠtwice.ĠSimilarly,ĠinternalĠverticalĠedgesĠ(V12,ĠV22)ĠareĠcountedĠtwice.ĊĊButĠtheĠtotalĠsumĠofĠallĠfourĠsquaresĠis:ĊĊ(H11Ġ+ĠH12Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠH31Ġ+ĠH32)Ġ+Ġ(V11Ġ+ĠV12Ġ+ĠV13Ġ+ĠV21Ġ+ĠV22Ġ+ĠV23)Ġ+Ġ(H21Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12Ġ+ĠV22)Ġ=Ġ8.ĊĊWait,Ġthat'sĠconfusing.ĠAlternatively,Ġlet'sĠdenote:ĊĊLetĠS_HĠbeĠtheĠsumĠofĠallĠhorizontalĠedgesĠ(eachĠcountedĠonce),ĠandĠS_VĠbeĠtheĠsumĠofĠallĠverticalĠedgesĠ(eachĠcountedĠonce).ĠThen,ĠtheĠtotalĠsumĠoverĠallĠsquaresĠisĠS_HĠ+ĠS_VĠ+Ġ(H21Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12Ġ+ĠV22)Ġ=Ġ8.ĊĊButĠH21Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12Ġ+ĠV22ĠareĠinternalĠedges,ĠeachĠcountedĠtwiceĠinĠtheĠtotalĠsum.ĊĊButĠS_HĠ+ĠS_VĠisĠtheĠtotalĠnumberĠofĠredĠedgesĠinĠtheĠentireĠgrid.ĊĊTherefore,ĠweĠhave:ĊĊ(S_HĠ+ĠS_V)Ġ+Ġ(H21Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12Ġ+ĠV22)Ġ=Ġ8.ĊĊButĠH21Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12Ġ+ĠV22ĠisĠtheĠnumberĠofĠredĠinternalĠedges,ĠcountedĠtwiceĠinĠtheĠtotalĠsum.ĠWait,Ġactually,ĠinĠtheĠtotalĠsumĠoverĠsquares,ĠeachĠinternalĠedgeĠisĠcountedĠtwice,Ġso:ĊĊTotalĠsumĠoverĠsquaresĠ=ĠS_HĠ+ĠS_VĠ+Ġ(internalĠedgesĠcountedĠonce)Ġ=Ġ8.ĊĊWait,ĠmaybeĠanotherĠapproach:ĠEachĠinternalĠedgeĠisĠsharedĠbyĠtwoĠsquares,ĠsoĠinĠtheĠtotalĠsumĠoverĠallĠsquares,ĠinternalĠedgesĠareĠcountedĠtwice,ĠwhileĠboundaryĠedgesĠareĠcountedĠonce.ĠTherefore:ĊĊTotalĠsumĠoverĠsquaresĠ=Ġ(NumberĠofĠredĠboundaryĠedges)Ġ+Ġ2*(NumberĠofĠredĠinternalĠedges)Ġ=Ġ8.ĊĊLetĠmeĠcalculateĠtheĠnumberĠofĠboundaryĠedgesĠandĠinternalĠedges.ĊĊInĠtheĠ2x2ĠgridĠ(3x3Ġvertices):ĊĊBoundaryĠedges:ĠAllĠedgesĠonĠtheĠperimeter.ĊĊHorizontalĠboundaryĠedges:ĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH31,ĠH32.ĊĊVerticalĠboundaryĠedges:ĠV11,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV23.ĊĊSo,Ġ4ĠhorizontalĠ+Ġ4ĠverticalĠ=Ġ8ĠboundaryĠedges.ĊĊInternalĠedges:ĠTheĠremainingĠedges.ĊĊHorizontalĠinternalĠedges:ĠH21,ĠH22.ĊĊVerticalĠinternalĠedges:ĠV12,ĠV22.ĊĊSo,Ġ2ĠhorizontalĠ+Ġ2ĠverticalĠ=Ġ4ĠinternalĠedges.ĊĊTherefore,ĠtotalĠsumĠoverĠsquares:Ġsum_{squares}Ġ(redĠedgesĠperĠsquare)Ġ=Ġ8.ĊĊButĠsum_{squares}Ġ(redĠedgesĠperĠsquare)Ġ=Ġsum_{boundaryĠedges}ĠredĠ+Ġ2*sum_{internalĠedges}Ġred.ĊĊTherefore:ĊĊsum_{boundaryĠedges}ĠredĠ+Ġ2*sum_{internalĠedges}ĠredĠ=Ġ8.ĊĊNow,ĠletĠmeĠdenote:ĊĊLetĠBĠ=ĠnumberĠofĠredĠboundaryĠedges.ĊĊLetĠIĠ=ĠnumberĠofĠredĠinternalĠedges.ĊĊThen,ĠBĠ+Ġ2IĠ=Ġ8.ĊĊAlso,ĠtheĠtotalĠnumberĠofĠredĠedgesĠinĠtheĠgridĠisĠBĠ+ĠI.ĊĊButĠfromĠtheĠequation,ĠBĠ=Ġ8Ġ-Ġ2I.ĊĊSo,ĠtotalĠredĠedgesĠ=Ġ(8Ġ-Ġ2I)Ġ+ĠIĠ=Ġ8Ġ-ĠI.ĊĊSinceĠBĠandĠIĠmustĠbeĠnon-negativeĠintegers,ĠandĠIĠcanĠrangeĠsuchĠthatĠBĠ>=0.ĊĊSo,Ġ8Ġ-Ġ2IĠ>=Ġ0Ġ=>ĠIĠ<=4.ĊĊIĠcanĠbeĠ0,1,2,3,4.ĊĊTherefore,ĠtheĠtotalĠnumberĠofĠredĠedgesĠcanĠbeĠ8Ġ-ĠI,ĠsoĠ8,7,6,5,4.ĊĊButĠeachĠsquareĠhasĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠedges,ĠsoĠtheĠtotalĠnumberĠofĠredĠedgesĠperĠsquareĠisĠ2,ĠwithĠfourĠsquares,ĠsoĠ8ĠredĠedgeĠcounts,ĠbutĠsinceĠinternalĠedgesĠareĠshared,ĠtheĠtotalĠnumberĠofĠredĠedgesĠisĠ8Ġ-ĠI,ĠwhereĠIĠisĠtheĠnumberĠofĠinternalĠredĠedges.ĊĊSo,ĠtheĠtotalĠnumberĠofĠredĠedgesĠinĠtheĠgridĠisĠvariable,ĠdependingĠonĠI.ĊĊButĠinĠtermsĠofĠconstraints,ĠeachĠsquareĠhavingĠtwoĠredĠedgesĠimpliesĠthatĠBĠ+Ġ2IĠ=8.ĊĊButĠweĠalsoĠhaveĠconstraintsĠonĠeachĠsquareĠindividually.ĊĊSo,ĠtoĠfindĠtheĠnumberĠofĠcolorings,ĠweĠcanĠmodelĠthisĠasĠaĠsystemĠwithĠvariablesĠBĠandĠI,ĠbutĠperhapsĠit'sĠmoreĠcomplex.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠexpressĠtheĠsystemĠofĠequationsĠinĠtermsĠofĠvariablesĠandĠfindĠtheĠnumberĠofĠsolutions.ĊĊButĠit'sĠ12ĠvariablesĠandĠ4Ġequations,ĠsoĠ8ĠdegreesĠofĠfreedom?ĠButĠwithĠdependencies.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠfixĠsomeĠvariablesĠandĠexpressĠothersĠinĠterms.ĊĊButĠsinceĠallĠequationsĠareĠequalĠtoĠ2,Ġit'sĠaĠbitĠtricky.ĊĊWait,ĠmaybeĠthinkĠaboutĠtheĠdualĠgraph.ĊĊInĠplanarĠgraphs,ĠtheĠdualĠofĠaĠgridĠisĠanotherĠgrid.ĠMaybeĠconsideringĠtheĠdualĠcouldĠhelp.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠmodelĠtheĠgridĠasĠaĠgraphĠandĠtheĠproblemĠasĠaĠedge-coloringĠwithĠconstraintsĠonĠfaces.ĊĊButĠperhapsĠnot.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠthinkĠofĠeachĠsquareĠindependently:ĠeachĠsquareĠcanĠhaveĠitsĠredĠedgesĠinĠdifferentĠconfigurations.ĠHowever,ĠsinceĠedgesĠareĠshared,ĠtheĠconfigurationsĠareĠnotĠindependent.ĊĊButĠforĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid,ĠperhapsĠenumerateĠallĠpossibilities.ĊĊButĠ2x2ĠgridĠhasĠfourĠsquares,ĠeachĠwithĠfourĠedges,ĠbutĠedgesĠareĠshared.ĠSo,ĠtheĠnumberĠofĠconfigurationsĠisĠnotĠtooĠlarge,ĠbutĠperhapsĠit'sĠmanageable.ĊĊButĠ2^12ĠisĠ4096Ġpossibilities,ĠwhichĠisĠtooĠmany.ĠSo,ĠneedĠaĠsmarterĠapproach.ĊĊWait,ĠperhapsĠnoteĠthatĠtheĠgridĠisĠaĠplanarĠgraphĠandĠtheĠproblemĠisĠrelatedĠtoĠtheĠcycleĠspace.ĊĊInĠgraphĠtheory,ĠtheĠcycleĠspaceĠisĠtheĠsetĠofĠallĠedgeĠsetsĠthatĠformĠcycles.ĠInĠthisĠproblem,ĠtheĠconstraintsĠareĠthatĠeachĠfaceĠ(square)ĠmustĠhaveĠanĠevenĠnumberĠofĠredĠedgesĠ(exactlyĠtwo,ĠwhichĠisĠeven).ĠSo,ĠtheĠredĠedgesĠmustĠformĠanĠelementĠofĠtheĠcycleĠspace.ĊĊButĠinĠourĠcase,ĠexactlyĠtwoĠedgesĠperĠface,ĠsoĠit'sĠaĠspecificĠcycle.ĊĊWait,ĠmoreĠprecisely,ĠtheĠredĠedgesĠmustĠformĠaĠ2-regularĠgraphĠonĠeachĠface,ĠbutĠnotĠnecessarilyĠglobally.ĊĊButĠsinceĠeachĠfaceĠmustĠhaveĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠedges,ĠwhichĠcanĠeitherĠformĠaĠpairĠofĠadjacentĠedgesĠ(aĠ"corner")ĠorĠaĠpairĠofĠoppositeĠedgesĠ(aĠ"cross").ĠĊĊSo,ĠeachĠsquareĠcanĠhaveĠtwoĠpossibleĠconfigurations:ĠeitherĠtheĠredĠedgesĠareĠadjacentĠorĠopposite.ĊĊButĠbecauseĠedgesĠareĠshared,ĠtheseĠconfigurationsĠpropagateĠconstraintsĠtoĠadjacentĠsquares.ĊĊSo,ĠperhapsĠtheĠentireĠgrid'sĠredĠedgesĠmustĠformĠaĠcollectionĠofĠcyclesĠorĠpaths.ĊĊButĠinĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid,ĠtheĠpossibleĠconfigurationsĠmightĠbeĠlimited.ĊĊWait,ĠanotherĠidea:ĠTheĠentireĠgridĠcanĠbeĠrepresentedĠasĠaĠgraph,ĠandĠtheĠredĠedgesĠmustĠformĠaĠ2-regularĠgraphĠonĠtheĠentireĠgrid,ĠbutĠthat'sĠnotĠnecessarilyĠtheĠcaseĠbecauseĠeachĠsquareĠonlyĠrequiresĠtwoĠredĠedges,ĠwhichĠcouldĠbeĠlocal.ĊĊWait,ĠbutĠ2-regularĠgraphsĠareĠcyclesĠcoveringĠallĠvertices.ĠHowever,ĠinĠourĠcase,ĠmaybeĠnotĠallĠverticesĠareĠcovered,ĠbutĠeachĠsquareĠhasĠtwoĠredĠedges.ĊĊWait,ĠperhapsĠnotĠdirectlyĠapplicable.ĊĊWait,ĠletĠmeĠthinkĠofĠtheĠredĠedgesĠasĠformingĠaĠperfectĠmatchingĠonĠeachĠsquare.ĊĊWait,ĠaĠperfectĠmatchingĠisĠaĠsetĠofĠedgesĠwithoutĠsharedĠvertices,ĠcoveringĠallĠvertices.ĠButĠinĠaĠsquare,ĠaĠperfectĠmatchingĠwouldĠconsistĠofĠtwoĠedges,ĠbutĠtheyĠwouldĠhaveĠtoĠbeĠoppositeĠedgesĠ(aĠcross),ĠsinceĠadjacentĠedgesĠshareĠaĠvertex.ĊĊSo,ĠinĠeachĠsquare,ĠtheĠredĠedgesĠcanĠeitherĠbeĠaĠcrossĠ(perfectĠmatching)ĠorĠtwoĠadjacentĠedgesĠ(whichĠisĠnotĠaĠperfectĠmatching,ĠasĠtheyĠshareĠaĠvertex).ĊĊSo,ĠeachĠsquareĠhasĠtwoĠchoices:ĠcrossĠorĠadjacentĠredĠedges.ĊĊButĠinĠtheĠadjacentĠcase,ĠtheĠredĠedgesĠwouldĠformĠaĠpathĠofĠlengthĠtwo,ĠwhichĠwouldĠconnectĠtoĠadjacentĠsquares.ĊĊSo,ĠperhapsĠtheĠentireĠgrid'sĠredĠedgesĠwouldĠformĠaĠcombinationĠofĠcyclesĠandĠpaths.ĊĊButĠeachĠsquare'sĠchoiceĠaffectsĠitsĠneighbors.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠmodelĠthisĠasĠaĠsystemĠwhereĠeachĠsquare'sĠconfigurationĠ(crossĠorĠadjacent)ĠpropagatesĠconstraintsĠonĠadjacentĠsquares.ĊĊThisĠseemsĠlikeĠaĠtilingĠproblemĠwhereĠeachĠtileĠcanĠbeĠinĠoneĠofĠtwoĠstates,ĠandĠadjacentĠtilesĠmustĠbeĠconsistent.ĊĊSo,ĠforĠeachĠsquare,ĠchooseĠcrossĠorĠadjacent,ĠensuringĠthatĠsharedĠedgesĠareĠconsistentlyĠcolored.ĊĊThisĠseemsĠmanageableĠforĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid.ĊĊSo,ĠperhapsĠweĠcanĠmodelĠthisĠasĠaĠstateĠmachineĠwhereĠeachĠsquare'sĠstateĠdependsĠonĠitsĠneighbors.ĊĊButĠwithĠfourĠsquares,Ġit'sĠstillĠaĠbitĠcomplex,ĠbutĠperhapsĠmanageable.ĊĊAlternatively,Ġlet'sĠconsiderĠtheĠpossibleĠconfigurationsĠforĠtheĠredĠedgesĠinĠtheĠentireĠgrid.ĊĊInĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid,ĠtheĠredĠedgesĠcanĠformĠvariousĠconfigurations:ĊĊ1.ĠAllĠredĠedgesĠformĠaĠsingleĠcycleĠaroundĠtheĠentireĠgrid.ĠForĠexample,ĠtheĠperimeter.ĊĊButĠtheĠperimeterĠhasĠ8Ġedges,ĠbutĠeachĠsquareĠrequiresĠtwoĠredĠedges,ĠsoĠ4ĠsquaresĠ*Ġ2ĠredĠedgesĠ=Ġ8ĠredĠedges.ĠSo,ĠtheĠperimeterĠwouldĠsatisfyĠthis.ĊĊ2.ĠRedĠedgesĠformĠtwoĠseparateĠcycles,ĠeachĠcoveringĠtwoĠsquares.ĠForĠexample,ĠtwoĠseparateĠ4-cycles.ĊĊButĠinĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid,Ġit'sĠdifficultĠtoĠhaveĠtwoĠseparateĠ4-cycles.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠtwoĠcyclesĠeachĠgoingĠaroundĠtwoĠsquares.ĊĊWait,Ġactually,ĠinĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid,ĠyouĠcanĠhaveĠaĠhorizontalĠcycleĠandĠaĠverticalĠcycle.ĊĊWait,ĠletĠmeĠvisualize.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠmaybeĠtheĠredĠedgesĠformĠaĠ"figure-eight"Ġshape,ĠbutĠinĠaĠgrid,Ġthat'sĠnotĠdirectlyĠpossible.ĊĊWait,ĠanotherĠidea:ĠTheĠredĠedgesĠcanĠformĠaĠ3D-likeĠcube,ĠbutĠprojectedĠontoĠ2D.ĊĊButĠthatĠmightĠnotĠbeĠdirectlyĠapplicable.ĊĊWait,ĠinĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid,ĠtheĠredĠedgesĠcanĠformĠdifferentĠconfigurations:ĊĊ-ĠAllĠhorizontalĠedgesĠred,ĠbutĠthatĠwouldĠgiveĠeachĠsquareĠfourĠredĠedges,ĠwhichĠisĠinvalid.ĊĊ-ĠAllĠverticalĠedgesĠred,ĠsameĠissue.ĊĊ-ĠAĠcheckerboardĠpattern:ĠalternatingĠredĠandĠblueĠedges.ĊĊWait,ĠifĠweĠcolorĠallĠhorizontalĠedgesĠredĠandĠverticalĠedgesĠblue,ĠeachĠsquareĠwouldĠhaveĠtwoĠredĠandĠtwoĠblueĠedges.ĠSo,Ġthat'sĠoneĠvalidĠconfiguration.ĊĊSimilarly,ĠcolorĠallĠverticalĠedgesĠredĠandĠhorizontalĠedgesĠblue:ĠanotherĠconfiguration.ĊĊSo,ĠatĠleastĠtwoĠconfigurations.ĊĊButĠareĠthereĠmore?ĊĊWait,ĠifĠweĠcolorĠtheĠperimeterĠredĠandĠtheĠinternalĠedgesĠblue,ĠeachĠsquareĠwouldĠhaveĠtwoĠredĠedgesĠ(theĠperimeterĠones)ĠandĠtwoĠblueĠedgesĠ(theĠinternalĠones).ĠSo,Ġthat'sĠanotherĠconfiguration.ĊĊSimilarly,ĠcolorĠtheĠinternalĠedgesĠredĠandĠtheĠperimeterĠblue:ĠeachĠsquareĠwouldĠhaveĠtwoĠredĠinternalĠedgesĠandĠtwoĠblueĠperimeterĠedges.ĠSo,Ġthat'sĠanotherĠconfiguration.ĊĊSo,ĠsoĠfar,ĠweĠhaveĠfourĠconfigurations:ĊĊ1.ĠAllĠhorizontalĠred,ĠverticalĠblue.ĊĊ2.ĠAllĠverticalĠred,ĠhorizontalĠblue.ĊĊ3.ĠPerimeterĠred,ĠinternalĠblue.ĊĊ4.ĠInternalĠred,ĠperimeterĠblue.ĊĊButĠwait,ĠinĠconfigurationĠ3,ĠtheĠinternalĠedgesĠareĠblue,ĠbutĠeachĠsquare'sĠinternalĠedgeĠisĠshared,ĠsoĠcoloringĠallĠinternalĠedgesĠblueĠwouldĠmeanĠeachĠsquareĠhasĠtwoĠblueĠinternalĠedges,ĠwhichĠisĠokayĠasĠlongĠasĠtheĠperimeterĠedgesĠsatisfyĠeachĠsquareĠhavingĠtwoĠredĠedges.ĊĊWait,ĠinĠconfigurationĠ3,ĠtheĠperimeterĠedgesĠareĠred.ĠEachĠsquareĠhasĠfourĠperimeterĠedges:Ġtop,Ġright,Ġbottom,Ġleft.ĠButĠwait,ĠinĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid,ĠeachĠsquareĠonlyĠhasĠfourĠedges,ĠwhichĠareĠeitherĠperimeterĠorĠinternal.ĊĊWait,Ġno.ĠWait,ĠeachĠsquareĠinĠtheĠ2x2ĠgridĠisĠaĠunitĠsquare.ĠSo,ĠeachĠsquareĠhasĠfourĠedges,ĠsomeĠofĠwhichĠareĠonĠtheĠperimeterĠofĠtheĠentireĠgrid,ĠandĠothersĠareĠinternal.ĊĊWait,ĠforĠcornerĠsquares,ĠtheyĠhaveĠtwoĠperimeterĠedgesĠandĠtwoĠinternalĠedges.ĠForĠedge-centerĠsquares,ĠtheyĠhaveĠoneĠperimeterĠedgeĠandĠthreeĠinternalĠedges.ĠWait,Ġno.ĊĊWait,ĠinĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid,ĠeachĠsquareĠisĠaĠcornerĠsquare?ĠNo,Ġactually,ĠinĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid,ĠthereĠareĠfourĠsquares:Ġtop-left,Ġtop-right,Ġbottom-left,Ġbottom-right.ĊĊEachĠsquareĠhasĠfourĠedges:Ġtop,Ġright,Ġbottom,Ġleft.ĊĊForĠtheĠtop-leftĠsquare,ĠtopĠandĠleftĠedgesĠareĠperimeterĠedges;ĠrightĠandĠbottomĠedgesĠareĠinternal.ĊĊSimilarly,Ġtop-rightĠsquare:ĠtopĠandĠrightĠareĠperimeter;ĠleftĠandĠbottomĠareĠinternal.ĊĊBottom-leftĠsquare:ĠleftĠandĠbottomĠareĠperimeter;ĠtopĠandĠrightĠareĠinternal.ĊĊBottom-rightĠsquare:ĠrightĠandĠbottomĠareĠperimeter;ĠtopĠandĠleftĠareĠinternal.ĊĊSo,ĠeachĠsquareĠhasĠtwoĠperimeterĠedgesĠandĠtwoĠinternalĠedges.ĊĊSo,ĠifĠweĠcolorĠallĠperimeterĠedgesĠredĠandĠinternalĠedgesĠblue,ĠthenĠeachĠsquareĠhasĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠedgesĠ(perimeter)ĠandĠtwoĠblueĠedgesĠ(internal).ĠSo,Ġthat'sĠaĠvalidĠconfiguration.ĊĊSimilarly,ĠifĠweĠcolorĠallĠinternalĠedgesĠredĠandĠperimeterĠedgesĠblue,ĠthenĠeachĠsquareĠhasĠtwoĠredĠedgesĠ(internal)ĠandĠtwoĠblueĠedgesĠ(perimeter).ĠSo,Ġthat'sĠalsoĠvalid.ĊĊSimilarly,ĠifĠweĠcolorĠallĠhorizontalĠedgesĠredĠandĠverticalĠedgesĠblue,ĠthenĠinĠeachĠsquare,ĠtheĠtwoĠhorizontalĠedgesĠareĠred,ĠandĠtheĠtwoĠverticalĠedgesĠareĠblue.ĠSo,ĠeachĠsquareĠhasĠtwoĠredĠandĠtwoĠblueĠedges.ĠSimilarly,ĠcoloringĠallĠverticalĠredĠandĠhorizontalĠblue.ĊĊSo,ĠtheseĠfourĠconfigurationsĠseemĠvalid.ĊĊAreĠthereĠanyĠothers?ĊĊWait,ĠanotherĠidea:ĠsupposeĠweĠcolorĠtwoĠhorizontalĠedgesĠredĠandĠtwoĠverticalĠedgesĠred,ĠbutĠinĠaĠwayĠthatĠeachĠsquareĠgetsĠtwoĠredĠedges.ĊĊForĠexample,ĠcolorĠtheĠtopĠandĠbottomĠhorizontalĠedgesĠred,ĠandĠtheĠleftĠandĠrightĠverticalĠedgesĠblue.ĠThen,ĠeachĠsquareĠwouldĠhaveĠtwoĠhorizontalĠredĠedgesĠandĠtwoĠverticalĠblueĠedges.ĊĊSimilarly,ĠcolorĠtheĠleftĠandĠrightĠverticalĠedgesĠred,ĠandĠtopĠandĠbottomĠhorizontalĠedgesĠblue.ĊĊWait,ĠbutĠthisĠisĠsimilarĠtoĠconfigurationsĠ1ĠandĠ2,ĠjustĠwithĠdifferentĠcolorĠassignments.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠsupposeĠweĠcolorĠtheĠtopĠhorizontalĠedgeĠred,ĠtheĠbottomĠhorizontalĠedgeĠred,ĠandĠtheĠleftĠandĠrightĠverticalĠedgesĠblue.ĠThen,ĠeachĠsquareĠwouldĠhaveĠtwoĠhorizontalĠredĠedgesĠandĠtwoĠverticalĠblueĠedges.ĊĊSimilarly,ĠcolorĠtheĠleftĠandĠrightĠverticalĠedgesĠred,ĠtopĠandĠbottomĠhorizontalĠedgesĠblue:ĠsameĠeffect.ĊĊSo,ĠthisĠseemsĠsimilarĠtoĠtheĠall-horizontalĠorĠall-verticalĠcolorings.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠsupposeĠweĠcolorĠaĠdiagonalĠsetĠofĠedgesĠred:ĠforĠexample,ĠcolorĠH11,ĠH32,ĠV13,ĠV21Ġred.ĠThen,ĠeachĠsquareĠwouldĠhaveĠtwoĠredĠedges.ĊĊWait,Ġlet'sĠcheck:ĊĊSquareĠ(1,1):ĠH11Ġ(red),ĠV12Ġ(blue),ĠH21Ġ(blue),ĠV11Ġ(blue).ĠWait,ĠonlyĠoneĠredĠedge.ĠThat'sĠnotĠvalid.ĊĊSo,ĠthatĠdoesn'tĠwork.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠcolorĠH11,ĠH22,ĠV12,ĠV21Ġred.ĊĊCheckĠsquareĠ(1,1):ĠH11Ġ(red),ĠV12Ġ(red),ĠH21Ġ(blue),ĠV11Ġ(blue).ĠSo,ĠtwoĠredĠedges:Ġgood.ĊĊSquareĠ(1,2):ĠH12Ġ(blue),ĠV13Ġ(blue),ĠH22Ġ(red),ĠV12Ġ(red).ĠTwoĠredĠedges:Ġgood.ĊĊSquareĠ(2,1):ĠH21Ġ(blue),ĠV22Ġ(blue),ĠH31Ġ(blue),ĠV21Ġ(red).ĠOnlyĠoneĠredĠedge:Ġbad.ĊĊSo,ĠsquareĠ(2,1)ĠonlyĠhasĠoneĠredĠedge.ĠSo,Ġthat'sĠinvalid.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠcolorĠH11,ĠH22,ĠV13,ĠV24Ġred.ĊĊWait,ĠinĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid,ĠV24Ġdoesn'tĠexistĠbecauseĠjĠgoesĠupĠtoĠ3.ĠSo,ĠV23ĠisĠtheĠlastĠverticalĠedge.ĊĊWait,ĠperhapsĠcolorĠH11,ĠH22,ĠV12,ĠV23Ġred.ĊĊCheck:ĊĊSquareĠ(1,1):ĠH11Ġ(red),ĠV12Ġ(red),ĠH21Ġ(blue),ĠV11Ġ(blue).ĠTwoĠredĠedges:Ġgood.ĊĊSquareĠ(1,2):ĠH12Ġ(blue),ĠV13Ġ(blue),ĠH22Ġ(red),ĠV12Ġ(red).ĠTwoĠredĠedges:Ġgood.ĊĊSquareĠ(2,1):ĠH21Ġ(blue),ĠV22Ġ(blue),ĠH31Ġ(blue),ĠV21Ġ(blue).ĠZeroĠredĠedges:Ġbad.ĊĊSquareĠ(2,2):ĠH22Ġ(red),ĠV23Ġ(red),ĠH32Ġ(blue),ĠV22Ġ(blue).ĠTwoĠredĠedges:Ġgood.ĊĊButĠsquareĠ(2,1)ĠhasĠzeroĠredĠedges.ĠSo,Ġinvalid.ĊĊSo,ĠthisĠapproachĠmayĠnotĠwork.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠcolorĠH11,ĠH31,ĠV11,ĠV33Ġred.ĊĊButĠV33Ġdoesn'tĠexistĠinĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid.ĠSo,ĠV23ĠisĠtheĠlastĠverticalĠedge.ĊĊWait,ĠperhapsĠcolorĠH11,ĠH32,ĠV13,ĠV21Ġred.ĊĊCheck:ĊĊSquareĠ(1,1):ĠH11Ġ(red),ĠV12Ġ(blue),ĠH21Ġ(blue),ĠV11Ġ(blue).ĠOnlyĠoneĠredĠedge:Ġbad.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠmaybeĠcolorĠedgesĠinĠaĠcycle.ĊĊColorĠH11,ĠV12,ĠH22,ĠV21Ġred.ĊĊCheck:ĊĊSquareĠ(1,1):ĠH11Ġ(red),ĠV12Ġ(red),ĠH21Ġ(blue),ĠV11Ġ(blue).ĠTwoĠredĠedges:Ġgood.ĊĊSquareĠ(1,2):ĠH12Ġ(blue),ĠV13Ġ(blue),ĠH22Ġ(red),ĠV12Ġ(red).ĠTwoĠredĠedges:Ġgood.ĊĊSquareĠ(2,1):ĠH21Ġ(blue),ĠV22Ġ(blue),ĠH31Ġ(blue),ĠV21Ġ(red).ĠOnlyĠoneĠredĠedge:Ġbad.ĊĊSquareĠ(2,2):ĠH22Ġ(red),ĠV23Ġ(blue),ĠH32Ġ(blue),ĠV22Ġ(blue).ĠOnlyĠoneĠredĠedge:Ġbad.ĊĊSo,Ġinvalid.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠcolorĠH11,ĠV12,ĠH22,ĠV21,ĠH31,ĠV22,ĠH32,ĠV23Ġred,ĠbutĠthat'sĠallĠedges,ĠwhichĠisĠinvalid.ĊĊWait,ĠthisĠisĠgettingĠmessy.ĠMaybeĠit'sĠbetterĠtoĠthinkĠthatĠtheĠonlyĠvalidĠconfigurationsĠareĠtheĠfourĠweĠidentifiedĠearlier:ĠallĠhorizontal,ĠallĠvertical,ĠallĠperimeter,ĠallĠinternal.ĊĊButĠletĠmeĠthinkĠagain.ĊĊWait,ĠisĠtheĠconfigurationĠwhereĠtheĠredĠedgesĠformĠtwoĠseparateĠ4-cyclesĠpossible?ĊĊInĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid,Ġit'sĠimpossibleĠtoĠhaveĠtwoĠseparateĠ4-cyclesĠbecauseĠtheĠgridĠitselfĠisĠaĠsingleĠ4x4Ġcycle.ĊĊWait,Ġno,ĠaĠ2x2ĠgridĠisĠfourĠsquaresĠarrangedĠinĠ2ĠrowsĠandĠ2Ġcolumns,ĠmakingĠaĠlargerĠsquare.ĠSo,ĠtheĠentireĠgridĠisĠaĠsingleĠ4-cycle.ĊĊWait,Ġno,Ġactually,ĠinĠaĠ2x2ĠgridĠofĠsquares,ĠtheĠdualĠgraphĠisĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid,ĠwhichĠisĠaĠsingleĠ4-nodeĠgraph,ĠeachĠnodeĠconnectedĠtoĠitsĠneighbors.ĊĊButĠtheĠoriginalĠgridĠisĠaĠplanarĠgraphĠwithĠcycles.ĊĊButĠactually,ĠtheĠgridĠitselfĠisĠaĠplanarĠgraphĠwithĠmultipleĠcycles.ĊĊWait,ĠperhapsĠit'sĠbetterĠtoĠthinkĠthatĠthereĠareĠmultipleĠwaysĠtoĠsatisfyĠtheĠconstraintsĠbeyondĠtheĠfourĠconfigurationsĠIĠinitiallyĠthought.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠmodelĠtheĠproblemĠasĠaĠbinaryĠmatrixĠandĠfindĠtheĠnumberĠofĠsolutions.ĊĊButĠwithĠ12ĠvariablesĠandĠ4Ġequations,Ġit'sĠaĠbitĠinvolved.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠnoticeĠthatĠtheĠproblemĠisĠsimilarĠtoĠcountingĠtheĠnumberĠofĠEulerianĠorientations,ĠbutĠagain,ĠperhapsĠnot.ĊĊWait,ĠanotherĠidea:ĠtheĠgridĠgraphĠisĠbipartite,ĠandĠweĠcanĠuseĠKasteleyn'sĠtheoremĠtoĠcountĠtheĠnumberĠofĠperfectĠmatchings,ĠbutĠinĠthisĠcase,ĠweĠdon'tĠneedĠperfectĠmatchings,ĠbutĠeachĠfaceĠhasĠexactlyĠtwoĠredĠedges.ĊĊWait,ĠKasteleyn'sĠtheoremĠisĠaboutĠcountingĠperfectĠmatchings,ĠwhichĠisn'tĠdirectlyĠourĠcase,ĠbutĠmaybeĠaĠsimilarĠapproachĠcanĠbeĠused.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠuseĠtheĠtransferĠmatrixĠmethod,ĠconsideringĠeachĠrowĠasĠaĠstateĠandĠbuildingĠupĠtheĠgridĠrowĠbyĠrow,ĠkeepingĠtrackĠofĠtheĠnecessaryĠconstraints.ĊĊButĠforĠaĠ2x2Ġgrid,Ġit'sĠmanageable.ĊĊLetĠmeĠtryĠtoĠmodelĠtheĠgridĠrowĠbyĠrow.ĊĊFirst,ĠlabelĠtheĠhorizontalĠedgesĠasĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH21,ĠH22,ĠH31,ĠH32.ĊĊVerticalĠedgesĠasĠV11,ĠV12,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV22,ĠV23.ĊĊNow,ĠconsiderĠtheĠfirstĠrowĠ(topĠrow):ĠsquaresĠ(1,1)ĠandĠ(1,2).ĊĊEachĠsquareĠinĠtheĠfirstĠrowĠhasĠitsĠtopĠedgeĠasĠH11ĠorĠH12,ĠverticalĠedgesĠasĠV12ĠorĠV13.ĊĊSimilarly,ĠtheĠbottomĠedgesĠofĠtheĠfirstĠrowĠareĠH21ĠandĠH22.ĊĊSo,ĠperhapsĠmodelĠtheĠstateĠofĠtheĠverticalĠedgesĠafterĠtheĠfirstĠrow.ĊĊWait,ĠforĠeachĠsquareĠinĠtheĠfirstĠrow,ĠtheĠstateĠcanĠbeĠtheĠcolorĠofĠtheĠverticalĠedgeĠonĠitsĠrightĠsideĠ(V12ĠorĠV13),ĠandĠtheĠhorizontalĠedgeĠbelowĠitĠ(H21ĠorĠH22).ĊĊButĠthisĠmightĠgetĠcomplex.ĊĊWait,ĠperhapsĠuseĠdynamicĠprogrammingĠwhereĠtheĠstateĠisĠtheĠcoloringĠofĠtheĠverticalĠedgesĠinĠtheĠcurrentĠcolumn,ĠandĠweĠbuildĠupĠcolumnĠbyĠcolumn.ĊĊButĠwithĠfourĠsquares,Ġit'sĠmanageable.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠthinkĠofĠtheĠgridĠasĠtwoĠcolumns,ĠeachĠwithĠtwoĠsquares.ĊĊWait,ĠthisĠisĠgettingĠtooĠvague.ĊĊPerhapsĠit'sĠbetterĠtoĠrealizeĠthatĠeachĠsquareĠmustĠhaveĠtwoĠredĠedges,ĠandĠtheĠentireĠgridĠmustĠsatisfyĠtheseĠconstraints.ĊĊGivenĠthat,ĠandĠknowingĠthatĠeachĠinternalĠedgeĠisĠsharedĠbyĠtwoĠsquares,ĠtheĠproblemĠreducesĠtoĠsolvingĠtheĠsystemĠofĠequations.ĊĊSo,ĠweĠhaveĠfourĠequations:ĊĊ1.ĠH11Ġ+ĠV12Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV11Ġ=Ġ2ĊĊ2.ĠH12Ġ+ĠV13Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12Ġ=Ġ2ĊĊ3.ĠH21Ġ+ĠV22Ġ+ĠH31Ġ+ĠV21Ġ=Ġ2ĊĊ4.ĠH22Ġ+ĠV23Ġ+ĠH32Ġ+ĠV22Ġ=Ġ2ĊĊWeĠcanĠwriteĠtheseĠequationsĠas:ĊĊ1.ĠH11Ġ+ĠV12Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV11Ġ=Ġ2ĊĊ2.ĠH12Ġ+ĠV13Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12Ġ=Ġ2ĊĊ3.ĠH21Ġ+ĠV22Ġ+ĠH31Ġ+ĠV21Ġ=Ġ2ĊĊ4.ĠH22Ġ+ĠV23Ġ+ĠH32Ġ+ĠV22Ġ=Ġ2ĊĊLetĠmeĠtryĠtoĠexpressĠvariablesĠinĠtermsĠofĠothers.ĊĊFromĠequationĠ1:ĊĊH11Ġ=Ġ2Ġ-ĠV12Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV11ĊĊSimilarly,ĠfromĠequationĠ2:ĊĊH12Ġ=Ġ2Ġ-ĠV13Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV12ĊĊFromĠequationĠ3:ĊĊH31Ġ=Ġ2Ġ-ĠV22Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV21ĊĊFromĠequationĠ4:ĊĊH32Ġ=Ġ2Ġ-ĠV23Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV22ĊĊSo,ĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH31,ĠH32ĠcanĠbeĠexpressedĠinĠtermsĠofĠVĠvariablesĠandĠH21,ĠH22.ĊĊSo,Ġnow,ĠweĠcanĠsubstituteĠtheseĠintoĠtheĠtotalĠsumĠequation.ĊĊButĠweĠalsoĠhaveĠtheĠtotalĠsumĠoverĠallĠsquaresĠis:ĊĊBĠ+Ġ2IĠ=8,ĠwhereĠBĠisĠboundaryĠredĠedges,ĠIĠisĠinternalĠredĠedges.ĊĊButĠBĠincludesĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH31,ĠH32,ĠV11,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV23.ĊĊIĠincludesĠH21,ĠH22,ĠV12,ĠV22.ĊĊSo,ĠBĠ=ĠH11Ġ+ĠH12Ġ+ĠH31Ġ+ĠH32Ġ+ĠV11Ġ+ĠV13Ġ+ĠV21Ġ+ĠV23ĊĊSubstituteĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH31,ĠH32:ĊĊBĠ=Ġ(2Ġ-ĠV12Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV11)Ġ+Ġ(2Ġ-ĠV13Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV12)Ġ+Ġ(2Ġ-ĠV22Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV21)Ġ+Ġ(2Ġ-ĠV23Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV22)Ġ+ĠV11Ġ+ĠV13Ġ+ĠV21Ġ+ĠV23ĊĊSimplify:ĊĊ=Ġ[2Ġ+Ġ2Ġ+Ġ2Ġ+Ġ2]Ġ+Ġ[-V12Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV11Ġ-ĠV13Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV12Ġ-ĠV22Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV21Ġ-ĠV23Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV22]Ġ+Ġ[V11Ġ+ĠV13Ġ+ĠV21Ġ+ĠV23]ĊĊ=Ġ8Ġ+Ġ(-V12*2Ġ-ĠH21*2Ġ-ĠV11Ġ-ĠV13Ġ-ĠH22*2Ġ-ĠV22*2Ġ-ĠV21Ġ-ĠV23)Ġ+Ġ(V11Ġ+ĠV13Ġ+ĠV21Ġ+ĠV23)ĊĊ=Ġ8Ġ-Ġ2V12Ġ-Ġ2H21Ġ-Ġ2H22Ġ-Ġ2V22Ġ-ĠV11Ġ-ĠV13Ġ-ĠV21Ġ-ĠV23Ġ+ĠV11Ġ+ĠV13Ġ+ĠV21Ġ+ĠV23ĊĊSimplifyĠterms:ĊĊ-ĠV11ĠcancelsĠwithĠ+ĠV11ĊĊ-ĠV13ĠcancelsĠwithĠ+ĠV13ĊĊ-ĠV21ĠcancelsĠwithĠ+ĠV21ĊĊ-ĠV23ĠcancelsĠwithĠ+ĠV23ĊĊSo,ĠleftĠwith:ĊĊ8Ġ-Ġ2V12Ġ-Ġ2H21Ġ-Ġ2H22Ġ-Ġ2V22ĊĊThus,ĠBĠ=Ġ8Ġ-Ġ2(V12Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV22)ĊĊButĠrecallĠthatĠIĠ=ĠH21Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12Ġ+ĠV22ĊĊSo,ĠBĠ=8Ġ-Ġ2IĊĊWhichĠmatchesĠtheĠearlierĠequation.ĊĊSo,Ġnow,ĠtheĠtotalĠnumberĠofĠredĠedgesĠis:ĊĊTotalĠredĠedgesĠ=ĠBĠ+ĠIĠ=Ġ(8Ġ-Ġ2I)Ġ+ĠIĠ=Ġ8Ġ-ĠIĊĊAsĠbefore.ĊĊButĠalso,ĠfromĠtheĠequationsĠabove,ĠweĠcanĠtryĠtoĠexpressĠvariables.ĊĊLetĠmeĠdefine:ĊĊLetĠmeĠsetĠvariablesĠH21,ĠH22,ĠV12,ĠV22ĠasĠfreeĠvariables,ĠsinceĠtheyĠareĠinternalĠedges.ĊĊEachĠcanĠbeĠ0ĠorĠ1.ĊĊButĠwithĠtheĠconstraintĠthatĠBĠ=8Ġ-Ġ2IĠmustĠbeĠnon-negative,ĠsoĠIĠ<=4.ĊĊSo,ĠIĠcanĠbeĠ0,1,2,3,4.ĊĊButĠIĠisĠtheĠnumberĠofĠredĠinternalĠedges,ĠwhichĠareĠH21,ĠH22,ĠV12,ĠV22.ĊĊEachĠofĠtheseĠisĠ0Ġor1,ĠsoĠIĠcanĠrangeĠfromĠ0Ġto4.ĊĊButĠH21,ĠH22,ĠV12,ĠV22ĠmustĠsatisfyĠthatĠtheĠexpressionsĠforĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH31,ĠH32ĠareĠnon-negativeĠ(sinceĠtheyĠareĠcountsĠofĠredĠedges,ĠmustĠbeĠ0Ġor1).ĊĊSo,Ġlet'sĠexpressĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH31,ĠH32ĠinĠtermsĠofĠH21,ĠH22,ĠV12,ĠV22.ĊĊFromĠequationĠ1:ĊĊH11Ġ=Ġ2Ġ-ĠV12Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV11ĊĊButĠH11ĠmustĠbeĠ0Ġor1.ĊĊSimilarly,ĠH12Ġ=Ġ2Ġ-ĠV13Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV12ĊĊH31Ġ=Ġ2Ġ-ĠV22Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV21ĊĊH32Ġ=Ġ2Ġ-ĠV23Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV22ĊĊButĠV11,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV23ĠareĠboundaryĠverticalĠedges,ĠwhichĠcanĠbeĠ0Ġor1.ĊĊWait,ĠbutĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH31,ĠH32ĠmustĠbeĠ0Ġor1,Ġso:ĊĊFromĠH11Ġ=Ġ2Ġ-ĠV12Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV11Ġ>=0ĊĊSo,Ġ2Ġ-ĠV12Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV11Ġ>=0Ġ=>ĠV12Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV11Ġ<=2ĊĊSimilarly,ĠsinceĠallĠvariablesĠareĠ0Ġor1,ĠtheĠsumĠV12Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV11ĠcanĠbeĠ0,1,2,3.ĊĊButĠ2Ġ-Ġ(sum)ĠmustĠbeĠ>=0,ĠsoĠsumĠ<=2.ĊĊSimilarly,ĠH12Ġ=Ġ2Ġ-ĠV13Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV12Ġ>=0Ġ=>ĠV13Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12Ġ<=2ĊĊH31Ġ=Ġ2Ġ-ĠV22Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV21Ġ>=0Ġ=>ĠV22Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV21Ġ<=2ĊĊH32Ġ=Ġ2Ġ-ĠV23Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV22Ġ>=0Ġ=>ĠV23Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV22Ġ<=2ĊĊSo,ĠtheseĠconstraintsĠmustĠbeĠsatisfied.ĊĊButĠV11,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV23ĠareĠvariablesĠthatĠcanĠbeĠchosenĠfreelyĠ(0Ġor1),ĠbutĠmustĠsatisfyĠtheseĠconstraints.ĊĊSo,ĠforĠeachĠpossibleĠcombinationĠofĠH21,ĠH22,ĠV12,ĠV22Ġ(theĠinternalĠedges),ĠweĠcanĠdetermineĠtheĠpossibleĠvaluesĠofĠV11,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV23ĠthatĠsatisfyĠtheĠconstraints.ĊĊTherefore,ĠtheĠnumberĠofĠcoloringsĠisĠtheĠsumĠoverĠallĠpossibleĠinternalĠedgeĠcoloringsĠ(H21,ĠH22,ĠV12,ĠV22)ĠofĠtheĠnumberĠofĠboundaryĠverticalĠedgeĠcoloringsĠ(V11,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV23)ĠthatĠsatisfyĠtheĠconstraintsĠforĠthatĠinternalĠcoloring.ĊĊSo,Ġlet'sĠproceedĠstepĠbyĠstep.ĊĊFirst,ĠlistĠallĠpossibleĠinternalĠedgeĠcoloringsĠ(H21,ĠH22,ĠV12,ĠV22).ĠEachĠcanĠbeĠ0Ġor1,ĠsoĠ16Ġpossibilities.ĊĊForĠeach,ĠcomputeĠIĠ=ĠH21Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12Ġ+ĠV22.ĊĊThen,ĠcomputeĠtheĠconstraintsĠonĠV11,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV23:ĊĊ1.ĠV12Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV11Ġ<=2ĊĊ2.ĠV13Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12Ġ<=2ĊĊ3.ĠV22Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV21Ġ<=2ĊĊ4.ĠV23Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV22Ġ<=2ĊĊButĠsinceĠV11,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV23ĠareĠ0Ġor1,ĠandĠV12,ĠH21,ĠH22,ĠV22ĠareĠgiven,ĠweĠcanĠcomputeĠtheĠnumberĠofĠ(V11,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV23)ĠthatĠsatisfyĠallĠfourĠconstraints.ĊĊSo,ĠforĠeachĠofĠtheĠ16ĠinternalĠcolorings,ĠweĠcanĠcomputeĠtheĠnumberĠofĠvalidĠboundaryĠcolorings.ĊĊThen,ĠtheĠtotalĠnumberĠofĠcoloringsĠisĠtheĠsumĠoverĠallĠinternalĠcoloringsĠofĠtheĠnumberĠofĠvalidĠboundaryĠcoloringsĠforĠthatĠinternalĠcoloring.ĊĊSo,Ġlet'sĠproceed.ĊĊCaseĠ1:ĠI=0Ġ(allĠinternalĠedgesĠblue:ĠH21=0,ĠH22=0,ĠV12=0,ĠV22=0)ĊĊSo,ĠH21=0,ĠH22=0,ĠV12=0,ĠV22=0.ĊĊComputeĠconstraints:ĊĊ1.ĠV12Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV11Ġ=0Ġ+0Ġ+ĠV11Ġ<=2:ĠAlwaysĠtrue,ĠsinceĠV11<=1.ĊĊ2.ĠV13Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12Ġ=ĠV13Ġ+0Ġ+0Ġ<=2:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊ3.ĠV22Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV21Ġ=0Ġ+0Ġ+ĠV21Ġ<=2:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊ4.ĠV23Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV22Ġ=ĠV23Ġ+0Ġ+0Ġ<=2:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊSo,ĠallĠconstraintsĠareĠsatisfiedĠregardlessĠofĠV11,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV23.ĊĊThus,ĠV11,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV23ĠcanĠeachĠbeĠ0Ġor1,ĠsoĠ2^4=16Ġpossibilities.ĊĊButĠweĠalsoĠhaveĠtoĠensureĠthatĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH31,ĠH32ĠareĠ0Ġor1.ĊĊFromĠearlier:ĊĊH11Ġ=2Ġ-ĠV12Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV11Ġ=2Ġ-0Ġ-0Ġ-ĠV11=2Ġ-ĠV11.ĊĊSinceĠV11ĠisĠ0Ġor1,ĠH11=2Ġ-0=2ĠorĠ2Ġ-1=1.ĊĊButĠH11ĠmustĠbeĠ0Ġor1.ĠSo,ĠwhenĠV11=0,ĠH11=2Ġinvalid.ĠWhenĠV11=1,ĠH11=1Ġvalid.ĊĊSimilarly,ĠH12Ġ=2Ġ-ĠV13Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV12=2Ġ-ĠV13Ġ-0Ġ-0=2Ġ-ĠV13.ĊĊAgain,ĠV13=0:ĠH12=2Ġinvalid;ĠV13=1:ĠH12=1Ġvalid.ĊĊSimilarly,ĠH31=2Ġ-ĠV22Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV21=2Ġ-0Ġ-0Ġ-ĠV21=2Ġ-ĠV21.ĊĊV21=0:ĠH31=2Ġinvalid;ĠV21=1:ĠH31=1Ġvalid.ĊĊH32=2Ġ-ĠV23Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV22=2Ġ-ĠV23Ġ-0Ġ-0=2Ġ-ĠV23.ĊĊV23=0:ĠH32=2Ġinvalid;ĠV23=1:ĠH32=1Ġvalid.ĊĊSo,ĠtoĠhaveĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH31,ĠH32ĠvalidĠ(0Ġor1),ĠweĠmustĠhave:ĊĊV11=1,ĠV13=1,ĠV21=1,ĠV23=1.ĊĊThus,ĠonlyĠoneĠpossibility:ĠV11=1,ĠV13=1,ĠV21=1,ĠV23=1.ĊĊThus,ĠinĠcaseĠI=0,ĠonlyĠoneĠvalidĠcoloring.ĊĊCaseĠ2:ĠI=1Ġ(oneĠinternalĠedgeĠred)ĊĊThereĠareĠC(4,1)=4Ġsubcases:ĊĊSubcaseĠ2a:ĠH21=1,Ġothers=0.ĊĊSo,ĠH21=1,ĠH22=0,ĠV12=0,ĠV22=0.ĊĊComputeĠconstraints:ĊĊ1.ĠV12Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV11Ġ=0Ġ+1Ġ+ĠV11Ġ<=2:Ġ1Ġ+ĠV11Ġ<=2Ġ=>ĠV11Ġ<=1:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊ2.ĠV13Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12Ġ=ĠV13Ġ+0Ġ+0Ġ<=2:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊ3.ĠV22Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV21Ġ=0Ġ+1Ġ+ĠV21Ġ<=2:Ġ1Ġ+ĠV21Ġ<=2Ġ=>ĠV21Ġ<=1:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊ4.ĠV23Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV22Ġ=ĠV23Ġ+0Ġ+0Ġ<=2:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊSo,ĠconstraintsĠareĠsatisfiedĠforĠanyĠV11,ĠV13,ĠV21,ĠV23.ĊĊButĠweĠneedĠtoĠensureĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH31,ĠH32ĠareĠ0Ġor1.ĊĊCompute:ĊĊH11=2Ġ-ĠV12Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV11=2Ġ-0Ġ-1Ġ-ĠV11=1Ġ-ĠV11.ĊĊSinceĠV11ĠisĠ0Ġor1,ĠH11=1Ġ-0=1Ġor1Ġ-1=0.ĠBothĠvalid.ĊĊH12=2Ġ-ĠV13Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV12=2Ġ-ĠV13Ġ-0Ġ-0=2Ġ-ĠV13.ĊĊSo,ĠV13=0:ĠH12=2Ġinvalid;ĠV13=1:ĠH12=1Ġvalid.ĊĊH31=2Ġ-ĠV22Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV21=2Ġ-0Ġ-1Ġ-ĠV21=1Ġ-ĠV21.ĊĊV21=0:ĠH31=1;ĠV21=1:ĠH31=0.ĠBothĠvalid.ĊĊH32=2Ġ-ĠV23Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV22=2Ġ-ĠV23Ġ-0Ġ-0=2Ġ-ĠV23.ĊĊV23=0:ĠH32=2Ġinvalid;ĠV23=1:ĠH32=1Ġvalid.ĊĊSo,ĠtoĠhaveĠH12ĠandĠH32Ġvalid,ĠneedĠV13=1ĠandĠV23=1.ĊĊV11ĠandĠV21ĠcanĠbeĠ0Ġor1.ĊĊThus,ĠV13=1,ĠV23=1,ĠV11ĠandĠV21Ġfree.ĊĊSo,Ġ2^2=4Ġpossibilities.ĊĊThus,ĠSubcaseĠ2aĠhasĠ4Ġcolorings.ĊĊSubcaseĠ2b:ĠH22=1,Ġothers=0.ĊĊSo,ĠH22=1,ĠH21=0,ĠV12=0,ĠV22=0.ĊĊComputeĠconstraints:ĊĊ1.ĠV12Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV11=0Ġ+0Ġ+ĠV11Ġ<=2:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊ2.ĠV13Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12=ĠV13Ġ+1Ġ+0Ġ<=2Ġ=>ĠV13Ġ+1Ġ<=2Ġ=>ĠV13Ġ<=1:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊ3.ĠV22Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV21=0Ġ+0Ġ+ĠV21Ġ<=2:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊ4.ĠV23Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV22=ĠV23Ġ+1Ġ+0Ġ<=2Ġ=>ĠV23Ġ+1Ġ<=2Ġ=>ĠV23Ġ<=1:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊNow,ĠcheckĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH31,ĠH32:ĊĊH11=2Ġ-ĠV12Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV11=2Ġ-0Ġ-0Ġ-ĠV11=2Ġ-ĠV11.ĊĊV11=0:ĠH11=2Ġinvalid;ĠV11=1:ĠH11=1Ġvalid.ĊĊH12=2Ġ-ĠV13Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV12=2Ġ-ĠV13Ġ-1Ġ-0=1Ġ-ĠV13.ĊĊV13=0:ĠH12=1;ĠV13=1:ĠH12=0.ĠBothĠvalid.ĊĊH31=2Ġ-ĠV22Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV21=2Ġ-0Ġ-0Ġ-ĠV21=2Ġ-ĠV21.ĊĊV21=0:ĠH31=2Ġinvalid;ĠV21=1:ĠH31=1Ġvalid.ĊĊH32=2Ġ-ĠV23Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV22=2Ġ-ĠV23Ġ-1Ġ-0=1Ġ-ĠV23.ĊĊV23=0:ĠH32=1;ĠV23=1:ĠH32=0.ĠBothĠvalid.ĊĊThus,Ġconstraints:ĊĊV11=1,ĠV21=1.ĊĊV13ĠandĠV23ĠcanĠbeĠ0Ġor1.ĊĊThus,Ġ2^2=4Ġpossibilities.ĊĊSubcaseĠ2b:Ġ4Ġcolorings.ĊĊSubcaseĠ2c:ĠV12=1,Ġothers=0.ĊĊSo,ĠV12=1,ĠH21=0,ĠH22=0,ĠV22=0.ĊĊComputeĠconstraints:ĊĊ1.ĠV12Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV11=1Ġ+0Ġ+ĠV11Ġ<=2Ġ=>ĠV11Ġ<=1:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊ2.ĠV13Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12=ĠV13Ġ+0Ġ+1Ġ<=2Ġ=>ĠV13Ġ+1Ġ<=2Ġ=>ĠV13Ġ<=1:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊ3.ĠV22Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV21=0Ġ+0Ġ+ĠV21Ġ<=2:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊ4.ĠV23Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV22=ĠV23Ġ+0Ġ+0Ġ<=2:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊNow,ĠcheckĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH31,ĠH32.ĊĊH11=2Ġ-ĠV12Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV11=2Ġ-1Ġ-0Ġ-ĠV11=1Ġ-ĠV11.ĊĊV11=0:ĠH11=1;ĠV11=1:ĠH11=0.ĠBothĠvalid.ĊĊH12=2Ġ-ĠV13Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV12=2Ġ-ĠV13Ġ-0Ġ-1=1Ġ-ĠV13.ĊĊV13=0:ĠH12=1;ĠV13=1:ĠH12=0.ĠBothĠvalid.ĊĊH31=2Ġ-ĠV22Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV21=2Ġ-0Ġ-0Ġ-ĠV21=2Ġ-ĠV21.ĊĊV21=0:ĠH31=2Ġinvalid;ĠV21=1:ĠH31=1Ġvalid.ĊĊH32=2Ġ-ĠV23Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV22=2Ġ-ĠV23Ġ-0Ġ-0=2Ġ-ĠV23.ĊĊV23=0:ĠH32=2Ġinvalid;ĠV23=1:ĠH32=1Ġvalid.ĊĊThus,Ġconstraints:ĊĊV21=1,ĠV23=1.ĊĊV11ĠandĠV13ĠcanĠbeĠ0Ġor1.ĊĊThus,Ġ2^2=4Ġpossibilities.ĊĊSubcaseĠ2c:Ġ4Ġcolorings.ĊĊSubcaseĠ2d:ĠV22=1,Ġothers=0.ĊĊSo,ĠV22=1,ĠH21=0,ĠH22=0,ĠV12=0.ĊĊComputeĠconstraints:ĊĊ1.ĠV12Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV11=0Ġ+0Ġ+ĠV11Ġ<=2:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊ2.ĠV13Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV12=ĠV13Ġ+0Ġ+0Ġ<=2:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊ3.ĠV22Ġ+ĠH21Ġ+ĠV21=1Ġ+0Ġ+ĠV21Ġ<=2Ġ=>ĠV21Ġ<=1:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊ4.ĠV23Ġ+ĠH22Ġ+ĠV22=ĠV23Ġ+0Ġ+1Ġ<=2Ġ=>ĠV23Ġ+1Ġ<=2Ġ=>ĠV23Ġ<=1:ĠAlwaysĠtrue.ĊĊNow,ĠcheckĠH11,ĠH12,ĠH31,ĠH32.ĊĊH11=2Ġ-ĠV12Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV11=2Ġ-0Ġ-0Ġ-ĠV11=2Ġ-ĠV11.ĊĊV11=0:ĠH11=2Ġinvalid;ĠV11=1:ĠH11=1Ġvalid.ĊĊH12=2Ġ-ĠV13Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV12=2Ġ-ĠV13Ġ-0Ġ-0=2Ġ-ĠV13.ĊĊV13=0:ĠH12=2Ġinvalid;ĠV13=1:ĠH12=1Ġvalid.ĊĊH31=2Ġ-ĠV22Ġ-ĠH21Ġ-ĠV21=2Ġ-1Ġ-0Ġ-ĠV21=1Ġ-ĠV21.ĊĊV21=0:ĠH31=1;ĠV21=1:ĠH31=0.ĠBothĠvalid.ĊĊH32=2Ġ-ĠV23Ġ-ĠH22Ġ-ĠV22=2Ġ-ĠV23Ġ-0Ġ-1=1Ġ-ĠV23.ĊĊV23=0:ĠH32=1;ĠV23=1:ĠH32=0.ĠBothĠvalid.ĊĊThus,Ġconstraints:ĊĊV11=1,ĠV13=1.ĊĊV21ĠandĠV23ĠcanĠbeĠ0Ġor1.ĊĊThus,Ġ2^2=4Ġpossibilities.ĊĊSubcaseĠ2d:Ġ4Ġcolorings.ĊĊThus,ĠforĠI=1,ĠtotalĠcolorings:Ġ4+4+4+4=16.ĊĊCaseĠ3:ĠI=2Ġ(twoĠinternalĠedgesĠred)ĊĊThereĠareĠC(4,2)=6Ġsubcases.ĊĊSubcaseĠ3