ternĠandĠthenĠreadingĠitĠrowĠbyĠrow.ĊĊWait,ĠperhapsĠtheĠgridĠisĠalreadyĠtheĠencodedĠmessage,ĠwithĠeachĠrailĠonĠaĠseparateĠline.ĠSo,ĠtoĠdecode,ĠIĠneedĠtoĠinterleaveĠtheĠcharactersĠfromĠeachĠrailĠinĠtheĠorderĠtheyĠwereĠwritten.ĊĊButĠI'mĠgettingĠconfused.ĠMaybeĠIĠshouldĠlookĠforĠanĠexampleĠofĠhowĠtheĠRailĠFenceĠCipherĠworks.ĊĊForĠexample,Ġlet'sĠsayĠtheĠmessageĠisĠ"HELLOWORLD"ĠandĠweĠuseĠ3Ġrails.ĠTheĠcipherĠwouldĠarrangeĠitĠas:ĊĊHĠ.ĠEĠ.ĠLĠ.ĠOĠ.ĠWĠ.ĠOĠ.ĠRĠ.ĠLĠ.ĠDĊĊ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.ĊĊ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.Ġ.ĊĊButĠactually,Ġit'sĠwrittenĠinĠaĠzigzag,ĠsoĠtheĠfirstĠrailĠhasĠH,ĠE,ĠO,ĠO,ĠR,ĠD;ĠtheĠsecondĠrailĠhasĠL,ĠW,ĠL;ĠandĠtheĠthirdĠrailĠhasĠL,ĠO,ĠR,ĠL.ĊĊWait,Ġno,Ġthat'sĠnotĠcorrect.ĠLetĠmeĠwriteĠitĠproperly:ĊĊWithĠ3Ġrails,ĠtheĠmessageĠ"HELLOWORLD"ĠwouldĠbeĠwrittenĠas:ĊĊHĠĠĠOĠĠĠOĠĠĠRĊĠLĠWĠLĊĠĠEĠĠĠLĠĠĠDĊĊButĠactually,ĠtheĠcorrectĠarrangementĠis:ĊĊRowĠ0:ĠHĠ.Ġ.Ġ.ĠOĠ.Ġ.Ġ.ĠRĠ.ĠDĊĊRowĠ1:Ġ.ĠLĠ.ĠWĠ.ĠLĠ.Ġ.ĊĊRowĠ2:Ġ.Ġ.ĠEĠ.Ġ.Ġ.ĠOĠ.Ġ.ĊĊButĠI'mĠnotĠsure.ĠMaybeĠIĠshouldĠlookĠforĠaĠbetterĠexample.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠIĠcanĠfindĠtheĠnumberĠofĠrailsĠbyĠlookingĠforĠrepeatingĠpatternsĠorĠtheĠlengthĠofĠtheĠmessage.ĊĊButĠgivenĠthatĠIĠhaveĠtheĠgrid,ĠmaybeĠIĠcanĠreconstructĠtheĠmessageĠbyĠreadingĠitĠinĠaĠzigzagĠorder.ĊĊWait,ĠtheĠtransformationĠruleĠsays:ĠToĠdecode,ĠreadĠtheĠcharactersĠinĠzigzagĠorder:ĠDown-and-RightĠdiagonallyĠuntilĠyouĠhitĠtheĠbottomĠrail,ĠthenĠUp-and-RightĠdiagonallyĠuntilĠyouĠhitĠtheĠtopĠrail,ĠthenĠDown-and-RightĠagainĠetc.ĊĊSo,ĠtheĠdecodingĠprocessĠinvolvesĠreadingĠtheĠgridĠinĠaĠzigzagĠorder,ĠmovingĠdiagonallyĠdownĠandĠright,ĠthenĠupĠandĠright,ĠandĠsoĠon.ĊĊButĠwait,ĠtheĠgridĠisĠalreadyĠgivenĠwithĠtheĠmessageĠinĠaĠzigzagĠpattern.ĠSo,ĠtoĠdecode,ĠIĠneedĠtoĠreadĠtheĠmessageĠbyĠfollowingĠtheĠsameĠzigzagĠpath.ĊĊButĠI'mĠgettingĠtangledĠup.ĠMaybeĠIĠneedĠtoĠwriteĠdownĠtheĠgridĠstructure.ĊĊGivenĠthatĠeachĠrailĠisĠaĠlineĠinĠtheĠgrid,ĠandĠtheĠnumberĠofĠrailsĠisĠtheĠnumberĠofĠlines,ĠIĠcanĠtryĠtoĠreconstructĠtheĠmessageĠbyĠreadingĠtheĠgridĠinĠaĠzigzagĠorder.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠIĠcanĠreconstructĠtheĠgridĠasĠaĠ2DĠarrayĠandĠthenĠtraverseĠitĠinĠtheĠzigzagĠorder.ĊĊButĠwithoutĠknowingĠtheĠnumberĠofĠrails,Ġit'sĠdifficult.ĠMaybeĠIĠcanĠmakeĠanĠassumption.ĠLet'sĠassumeĠtheĠnumberĠofĠrailsĠisĠ3,ĠwhichĠisĠaĠcommonĠnumberĠforĠRailĠFence.ĊĊIfĠIĠassumeĠ3Ġrails,ĠthenĠIĠcanĠtryĠtoĠreadĠtheĠgridĠinĠaĠzigzagĠorder.ĠLet'sĠsee.ĊĊButĠgivenĠtheĠlengthĠofĠtheĠgrid,Ġ3ĠrailsĠmightĠnotĠbeĠsufficient.ĠAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠtheĠnumberĠofĠrailsĠisĠ5ĠorĠ6.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠmaybeĠIĠcanĠlookĠforĠtheĠperiodĠinĠtheĠgrid.ĠTheĠdotsĠ(.)ĠareĠfillers,ĠsoĠtheĠactualĠmessageĠconsistsĠofĠtheĠlettersĠandĠsymbols.ĊĊLookingĠatĠtheĠfirstĠline:ĊĊT..t...v...e...r..A...B..C..D...E..F...G...H...I...J...K...a...$...a...r...o......u......o...x...i...o...e...r..T..t..l...e...i...a..p........c...n......e......e...n..p...e...a...r......f.........-..t...w..s...n..h..t...e...x...r...a..l...e..l..b..c...y...o...x..l...a..s..l...e..t......$..C......$...E......$...H........b..l......t...e..s...o..l...e...o...i...$...i...\..c...$..h..................a...e..p...e..s...v...n...e......d...+....h..w.l.e.l.t.e.s.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$..n..L..r..a.d.m.y.g.o.p.d.i.t..i..a.r..f.l.t.e.s..h..w..e.t.r..n.e.c..a.r.a.e.p.a.e..e.t.t..a.h.o.h.r.i..l.h.b.t.c.l.o.d.r.t..o.m.s.x.t.o.l.t.e..o.d.,.a.d.t.e..h.s..i..o.d..r..i.t.d.a.p.a.e.i.a.l..F.r.e.a.p.e...o.s.b.e.r.s.l..s.$.B.,.$.J.,.$.G.,.$.K.,.$.L.,.$.I..T.e.p.o.a.i.i.y.t.a..h..a.t.w.r..i.t.d.c.n.a.n..G..s.$.f.a..n.,.w.e.e.$.$.$.a.d.$.$.a.e.r.l.t.v.l..r.m..o.i.i.e.i.t.g.r..F.n..m.n....e...e......t......,...,...,...,...,...,...,...,...,...,...,..d...$...e...n..l...r...e...n..s..p..s......t.......e...o..t..s......h...i...r..l..d...x...o..c..t......a...a...i......e...o...r...i...w...e...r...r.........n...o..s...w..s...e..s......h..t..l........m...,..p...i......u...i..A......$..D......$..F......$..h...r..b..t..h..t..l......d..s......t..s...$......r..m......r..m...n...n...r...e...i...y...i..p..t......e..s...i...$...$.ĊĊIt'sĠclearĠthatĠtheĠgridĠisĠquiteĠextensive,ĠwithĠmanyĠlines.ĠPerhapsĠtheĠnumberĠofĠrailsĠisĠ12ĠorĠmore.ĠAlternatively,ĠmaybeĠtheĠgridĠisĠstructuredĠinĠaĠwayĠthatĠeachĠrailĠisĠrepresentedĠbyĠaĠline,ĠwithĠdotsĠasĠfillers.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠtheĠgridĠisĠwrittenĠinĠaĠwayĠwhereĠeachĠrailĠisĠaĠsingleĠline,ĠbutĠtheĠmessageĠisĠwrittenĠinĠaĠzigzag,ĠsoĠtheĠnumberĠofĠrailsĠcanĠbeĠdeterminedĠbyĠtheĠnumberĠofĠlines.ĊĊGivenĠthat,ĠperhapsĠIĠcanĠconsiderĠthatĠtheĠnumberĠofĠrailsĠisĠ12,ĠasĠtheĠfirstĠlineĠhasĠ12ĠsegmentsĠseparatedĠbyĠdots.ĊĊButĠthisĠisĠspeculative.ĠAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠIĠcanĠlookĠforĠtheĠlengthĠofĠeachĠline.ĠEachĠlineĠhasĠtheĠsameĠlength,ĠsoĠperhapsĠtheĠnumberĠofĠrailsĠtimesĠtheĠlengthĠofĠeachĠrailĠequalsĠtheĠlengthĠofĠtheĠmessage.ĊĊButĠwithoutĠknowingĠtheĠmessageĠlength,Ġit'sĠhardĠtoĠdetermine.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠIĠcanĠreconstructĠtheĠgridĠasĠaĠ2DĠarrayĠwithĠeachĠrowĠbeingĠaĠrailĠandĠthenĠtraverseĠitĠinĠaĠzigzagĠorder.ĊĊButĠsinceĠIĠcan'tĠactuallyĠseeĠtheĠgridĠstructure,Ġit'sĠchallenging.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠtheĠgridĠisĠjustĠaĠwayĠtoĠrepresentĠtheĠencodedĠmessage,ĠandĠtheĠactualĠmessageĠisĠtheĠconcatenationĠofĠallĠtheĠnon-dotĠcharacters.ĊĊButĠthatĠseemsĠunlikelyĠbecauseĠtheĠRailĠFenceĠCipherĠencodesĠbyĠarrangingĠtheĠmessageĠinĠaĠgrid,ĠsoĠdecodingĠrequiresĠknowingĠtheĠgridĠstructure.ĊĊGivenĠthat,ĠperhapsĠIĠcanĠconsiderĠthatĠtheĠgridĠisĠaĠsingleĠrowĠwithĠtheĠmessageĠwrittenĠinĠaĠzigzag,ĠbutĠthatĠdoesn'tĠmakeĠsense.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠtheĠgridĠisĠaĠvisualĠrepresentationĠofĠtheĠencodedĠmessage,ĠwithĠeachĠrowĠbeingĠaĠrail.ĠTherefore,ĠtheĠnumberĠofĠrailsĠisĠtheĠnumberĠofĠlines,ĠandĠeachĠrailĠhasĠtheĠsameĠnumberĠofĠcharacters.ĊĊGivenĠthat,ĠtoĠdecode,ĠIĠneedĠtoĠreadĠtheĠmessageĠbyĠmovingĠdiagonallyĠdownĠandĠright,ĠthenĠupĠandĠright,Ġetc.,ĠasĠperĠtheĠtransformationĠrule.ĊĊButĠhowĠcanĠIĠdoĠthatĠwithoutĠknowingĠtheĠnumberĠofĠrails?ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠIĠcanĠconsiderĠthatĠtheĠgridĠisĠwrittenĠinĠaĠzigzag,ĠandĠtheĠmessageĠisĠreadĠrowĠbyĠrow.ĠSo,ĠtoĠdecode,ĠIĠneedĠtoĠinterleaveĠtheĠrowsĠinĠaĠzigzagĠmanner.ĊĊButĠthisĠisĠgettingĠtooĠabstract.ĠMaybeĠIĠcanĠtryĠaĠdifferentĠapproach.ĊĊPerhapsĠIĠcanĠextractĠtheĠmessageĠbyĠconcatenatingĠallĠtheĠnon-dotĠcharactersĠfromĠeachĠrowĠinĠorder.ĠButĠthatĠwouldĠjustĠgiveĠmeĠtheĠencodedĠmessage,ĠwhichĠisĠnotĠhelpful.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠtheĠgridĠisĠtheĠencodedĠmessage,ĠandĠIĠneedĠtoĠapplyĠtheĠRailĠFenceĠCipherĠinĠreverse.ĊĊWait,ĠperhapsĠtheĠgridĠisĠtheĠencodedĠmessage,ĠandĠtheĠtransformationĠruleĠisĠtheĠRailĠFenceĠCipherĠencoding.ĠTherefore,ĠtoĠdecode,ĠIĠneedĠtoĠreverseĠtheĠprocess.ĊĊButĠI'mĠstuckĠbecauseĠwithoutĠknowingĠtheĠnumberĠofĠrails,Ġit'sĠhardĠtoĠproceed.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠIĠcanĠlookĠforĠtheĠoriginalĠmessage'sĠlength.ĠTheĠlengthĠofĠtheĠencodedĠmessageĠisĠequalĠtoĠtheĠlengthĠofĠtheĠoriginalĠmessage,ĠsoĠperhapsĠIĠcanĠcountĠtheĠnumberĠofĠnon-dotĠcharactersĠinĠtheĠgrid.ĊĊButĠthatĠwouldĠrequireĠcountingĠeachĠcharacter,ĠwhichĠisĠtime-consuming.ĠAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠIĠcanĠestimateĠbasedĠonĠtheĠnumberĠofĠlines.ĊĊGivenĠthat,ĠperhapsĠIĠcanĠassumeĠthatĠtheĠnumberĠofĠrailsĠisĠ12,ĠasĠthatĠisĠaĠcommonĠnumberĠinĠsomeĠciphers,ĠandĠproceedĠaccordingly.ĊĊButĠwithoutĠaĠclearĠmethod,ĠI'mĠnotĠmakingĠprogress.ĠMaybeĠIĠneedĠtoĠthinkĠdifferently.ĊĊWait,ĠperhapsĠtheĠgridĠisĠaĠrepresentationĠofĠtheĠencodedĠmessage,ĠwithĠeachĠrailĠonĠaĠseparateĠline.ĠSo,ĠtoĠdecode,ĠIĠneedĠtoĠreconstructĠtheĠoriginalĠmessageĠbyĠreadingĠtheĠgridĠinĠaĠzigzagĠorder.ĊĊButĠhow?ĠTheĠgridĠisĠalreadyĠgiven,ĠsoĠperhapsĠtheĠmessageĠisĠreadĠbyĠfollowingĠtheĠzigzagĠpath.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠIĠcanĠwriteĠaĠsmallĠprogramĠorĠuseĠanĠalgorithmĠtoĠdecodeĠit,ĠbutĠsinceĠI'mĠdoingĠthisĠmanually,Ġit'sĠchallenging.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠIĠcanĠlookĠforĠtheĠstartingĠandĠendingĠpoints.ĠTheĠmessageĠstartsĠwithĠTĠandĠendsĠwithĠ$,ĠsoĠperhapsĠtheĠoriginalĠmessageĠstartsĠwithĠT.ĊĊButĠthatĠdoesn'tĠhelpĠmuch.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠIĠcanĠfindĠtheĠsequenceĠofĠcharactersĠbyĠfollowingĠtheĠzigzagĠpath.ĊĊWait,ĠtheĠtransformationĠruleĠsays:ĠToĠdecode,ĠreadĠtheĠcharactersĠinĠzigzagĠorder:ĠDown-and-RightĠdiagonallyĠuntilĠyouĠhitĠtheĠbottomĠrail,ĠthenĠUp-and-RightĠdiagonallyĠuntilĠyouĠhitĠtheĠtopĠrail,ĠthenĠDown-and-RightĠagainĠetc.ĊĊSo,ĠstartingĠfromĠtheĠtop-leftĠcorner,ĠmoveĠdownĠandĠtoĠtheĠrightĠdiagonally,ĠcollectingĠcharactersĠuntilĠreachingĠtheĠbottomĠrail,ĠthenĠmoveĠupĠandĠtoĠtheĠrightĠdiagonally,ĠcollectingĠcharactersĠuntilĠreachingĠtheĠtopĠrail,ĠandĠrepeat.ĊĊTherefore,ĠtheĠdecodingĠprocessĠinvolvesĠtraversingĠtheĠgridĠinĠthisĠzigzagĠdiagonalĠmanner.ĊĊGivenĠthat,ĠperhapsĠIĠcanĠsimulateĠthisĠtraversal.ĊĊButĠtoĠdoĠthat,ĠIĠneedĠtoĠknowĠtheĠnumberĠofĠrailsĠ(rows)ĠandĠtheĠnumberĠofĠcolumns.ĠSinceĠeachĠrailĠhasĠtheĠsameĠlength,ĠtheĠnumberĠofĠcolumnsĠisĠtheĠlengthĠofĠeachĠrow.ĊĊAssumingĠtheĠgridĠisĠNĠrowsĠbyĠMĠcolumns.ĊĊGivenĠthat,ĠtheĠdecodingĠprocessĠwouldĠinvolveĠmovingĠinĠdiagonals,ĠcollectingĠcharacters.ĊĊButĠwithoutĠtheĠactualĠgrid,Ġit'sĠhardĠtoĠvisualize.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠIĠcanĠparseĠtheĠgridĠlineĠbyĠlineĠandĠthenĠreconstructĠtheĠmessage.ĊĊButĠagain,ĠwithoutĠtheĠgrid,Ġit'sĠimpossible.ĊĊWait,ĠperhapsĠtheĠtransformedĠinputĠisĠtheĠgridĠitself,ĠwithĠeachĠlineĠrepresentingĠaĠrail.ĠTherefore,ĠtheĠgridĠisĠaĠmulti-lineĠstring,ĠwithĠeachĠlineĠbeingĠaĠrail,ĠandĠeachĠcharacterĠseparatedĠbyĠdots.ĊĊButĠIĠcan'tĠseeĠtheĠactualĠgridĠstructure,ĠsoĠIĠcan'tĠparseĠit.ĊĊAlternatively,ĠperhapsĠtheĠuserĠprovidedĠtheĠgridĠinĠaĠsingleĠstringĠwithĠdotsĠandĠletters,ĠwithĠeachĠlineĠseparatedĠbyĠaĠnewline.ĊĊGivenĠthat,ĠperhapsĠtheĠgridĠisĠasĠfollows:ĊĊLineĠ1:ĠT..t...v...e...r..A...B..C..D...E..F...G...H...I...J...K...a...$...a...r...o......u......o...x...i...o...e...r..T..t..l...e...i...a..p........c...n......e......e...n..p...e...a...r......f.........-..t...w..s...n..h..t...e...x...r...a..l...e..l..b..c...y...o...x..l...a..s..l...e..t......$..C......$...E......$...H........b..l......t...e..s...o..l...e...o...i...$...i...\..c...$..h..................a...e..p...e..s...v...n...e......d...+....h..w.l.e.l.t.e.s.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.$.